### npc/re/merchants/3rd_trader.txt  (29 textos)
#: npc/re/merchants/3rd_trader.txt#1 (npctalk)
- "Do you need poison?"
+ "Precisa de veneno?"
#: npc/re/merchants/3rd_trader.txt#4 (npctalk)
- "There are several types of runes."
+ "Existem vários tipos de runas."
#: npc/re/merchants/3rd_trader.txt#7 (mes)
- "- Wait a minute !! -"
+ "- Espera aí!! -"
#: npc/re/merchants/3rd_trader.txt#8 (mes)
- "- Currently you're carrying -"
+ "- Você está carregando -"
#: npc/re/merchants/3rd_trader.txt#9 (mes)
- "- too many items with you. -"
+ "- itens demais. -"
#: npc/re/merchants/3rd_trader.txt#10 (mes)
- "- Please try again -"
+ "- Tente de novo -"
#: npc/re/merchants/3rd_trader.txt#11 (mes)
- "- after you lose some weight. -"
+ "- depois de aliviar o peso. -"
#: npc/re/merchants/3rd_trader.txt#12 (mes)
- "[Rare Poison Herb Collector]"
+ "[Colecionador de Ervas Venenosas Raras]"
#: npc/re/merchants/3rd_trader.txt#13 (mes)
- "I wander around the world and collect rare poison herbs. Recently, I started dealing in the herb called Izidor. If you are interested, you can buy them."
+ "Eu viajo pelo mundo colecionando ervas venenosas raras. Há pouco tempo comecei a negociar a erva chamada Izidor. Se tiver interesse, pode comprá-las."
#: npc/re/merchants/3rd_trader.txt#14 (select)
- "How can I buy them?:Exchange it for Animal Blood:Exchange it for a Bitter Herb:Exchange it for a Deadly Noxious Herb:Exchange it for a Frozen Rose:Exchange it for Ment:Exchange it for Hinalle"
+ "Como posso comprá-las?:Trocar por Sangue de Animal:Trocar por Erva Amarga:Trocar por Erva Letal:Trocar por Rosa de Gelo:Trocar por Menta:Trocar por Hinalle"
#: npc/re/merchants/3rd_trader.txt#15 (mes)
- "[Rare Poison Herb Collector]"
+ "[Colecionador de Ervas Venenosas Raras]"
#: npc/re/merchants/3rd_trader.txt#16 (mes)
- "You can buy them for 10,000 zeny and one of these rare items, Animal Blood, Bitter Herb, Deadly Noxious Herb, Frozen Rose, Ment or an Hinalle."
+ "Você pode comprá-las por 10.000 zeny e um destes itens raros: Sangue de Animal, Erva Amarga, Erva Letal, Rosa de Gelo, Menta ou Hinalle."
#: npc/re/merchants/3rd_trader.txt#17 (mes)
- "[Rare Poison Herb Collector]"
+ "[Colecionador de Ervas Venenosas Raras]"
#: npc/re/merchants/3rd_trader.txt#18 (mes)
- "Why do I ask money? That's just to pay a little respect to a collector like me. Ha ha ha..."
+ "Por que eu cobro dinheiro? É só um pouco de respeito a um colecionador como eu. Ha ha ha..."
#: npc/re/merchants/3rd_trader.txt#19 (mes)
- "[Rare Poison Herb Collector]"
+ "[Colecionador de Ervas Venenosas Raras]"
#: npc/re/merchants/3rd_trader.txt#20 (mes)
- "How many do you want?"
+ "Quantas você quer?"
#: npc/re/merchants/3rd_trader.txt#21 (mes)
- "You can only buy a maximum of '2000' ea."
+ "Você pode comprar no máximo '2000' unidades."
#: npc/re/merchants/3rd_trader.txt#22 (mes)
- "Enter '0' if you want to cancel."
+ "Digite '0' se quiser cancelar."
#: npc/re/merchants/3rd_trader.txt#23 (mes)
- "[Rare Poison Herb Collector]"
+ "[Colecionador de Ervas Venenosas Raras]"
#: npc/re/merchants/3rd_trader.txt#24 (mes)
- "You've cancelled the trade."
+ "Você cancelou a troca."
#: npc/re/merchants/3rd_trader.txt#25 (mes)
- "[Rare Poison Herb Collector]"
+ "[Colecionador de Ervas Venenosas Raras]"
#: npc/re/merchants/3rd_trader.txt#26 (mes)
- "The number must be less than 2,000!"
+ "O número tem de ser menor que 2.000!"
#: npc/re/merchants/3rd_trader.txt#27 (mes)
- "[Rare Poison Herb Collector]"
+ "[Colecionador de Ervas Venenosas Raras]"
#: npc/re/merchants/3rd_trader.txt#28 (mes)
- "Hey, come back when you have all the requirements for the exchange."
+ "Ei, volte quando tiver tudo o que a troca pede."
#: npc/re/merchants/3rd_trader.txt#29 (mes)
- "[Rare Poison Herb Collector]"
+ "[Colecionador de Ervas Venenosas Raras]"
#: npc/re/merchants/3rd_trader.txt#30 (mes)
- "Good. I've received the money and the special item."
+ "Muito bem. Recebi o dinheiro e o item especial."
#: npc/re/merchants/3rd_trader.txt#31 (mes)
- "[Rare Poison Herb Collector]"
+ "[Colecionador de Ervas Venenosas Raras]"
#: npc/re/merchants/3rd_trader.txt#32 (mes)
- "I wander around the world and collect rare poison herbs. But I don't feel like selling my herbs to a person like you... ha ha ha..."
+ "Eu viajo pelo mundo colecionando ervas venenosas raras. Mas não estou com vontade de vender minhas ervas para alguém como você... ha ha ha..."
#: npc/re/merchants/3rd_trader.txt#33 (npctalk)
- "Do you have an element for each property?"
+ "Tem um elemento para cada propriedade?"

### npc/re/merchants/guild_warehouse.txt  (28 textos)
#: npc/re/merchants/guild_warehouse.txt#1 (mes)
- "[Warehouse Manager]"
+ "[Agente do Armazém]"
#: npc/re/merchants/guild_warehouse.txt#2 (mes)
- "How are you? We are specialized in guild warehouses. This is our ^0000cdstory^000000:"
+ "Como vai? Somos especialistas em armazéns de clã. Esta é a nossa ^0000cdhistória^000000:"
#: npc/re/merchants/guild_warehouse.txt#3 (mes)
- "Why can't guild members share a storage? We started off with that simple question."
+ "Por que os membros de um clã não podem dividir um armazém? Começamos com essa pergunta simples."
#: npc/re/merchants/guild_warehouse.txt#4 (mes)
- "[Warehouse Manager]"
+ "[Agente do Armazém]"
#: npc/re/merchants/guild_warehouse.txt#5 (mes)
- "You can open the warehouse for 1000 Zeny or look up the usage history of the guild."
+ "Você pode abrir o armazém por 1000 zeny ou consultar o histórico de uso do clã."
#: npc/re/merchants/guild_warehouse.txt#6 (mes)
- "How can I help you?"
+ "Em que posso ajudar?"
#: npc/re/merchants/guild_warehouse.txt#7 (select)
- "Open guild warehouse:View warehouse usage history"
+ "Abrir o armazém do clã:Ver o histórico de uso do armazém"
#: npc/re/merchants/guild_warehouse.txt#8 (mes)
- "[Warehouse Manager]"
+ "[Agente do Armazém]"
#: npc/re/merchants/guild_warehouse.txt#9 (mes)
- "The guild storage is only available for guild members."
+ "O armazém do clã só pode ser usado por membros do clã."
#: npc/re/merchants/guild_warehouse.txt#11 (mes)
- "[Warehouse Manager]"
+ "[Agente do Armazém]"
#: npc/re/merchants/guild_warehouse.txt#12 (mes)
- "It seems that it is not yet possible for your guild to use the guild warehouse or you do not have access permissions for the warehouse."
+ "Parece que o seu clã ainda não pode usar o armazém, ou você não tem permissão de acesso a ele."
#: npc/re/merchants/guild_warehouse.txt#13 (mes)
- "Please come back after checking the guild skill and the permission to access the warehouse."
+ "Volte depois de conferir a habilidade de clã e a permissão de acesso ao armazém."
#: npc/re/merchants/guild_warehouse.txt#14 (mes)
- "[Warehouse Manager]"
+ "[Agente do Armazém]"
#: npc/re/merchants/guild_warehouse.txt#15 (mes)
- "I am afraid you do not have enough money to settle the fee."
+ "Receio que você não tenha dinheiro suficiente para pagar a taxa."
#: npc/re/merchants/guild_warehouse.txt#16 (mes)
- "The fee is 1000 Zeny."
+ "A taxa é de 1000 zeny."
#: npc/re/merchants/guild_warehouse.txt#17 (mes)
- "[Warehouse Manager]"
+ "[Agente do Armazém]"
#: npc/re/merchants/guild_warehouse.txt#18 (mes)
- "I will open the guild storage for you then. Have a memorable time!"
+ "Então vou abrir o armazém do clã para você. Aproveite!"
#: npc/re/merchants/guild_warehouse.txt#19 (mes)
- "[Warehouse Manager]"
+ "[Agente do Armazém]"
#: npc/re/merchants/guild_warehouse.txt#20 (mes)
- "I am afraid someone else is using the warehouse right now."
+ "Receio que outra pessoa esteja usando o armazém agora."
#: npc/re/merchants/guild_warehouse.txt#21 (mes)
- "Please try again after a while."
+ "Tente de novo daqui a pouco."
#: npc/re/merchants/guild_warehouse.txt#22 (mes)
- "[Warehouse Manager]"
+ "[Agente do Armazém]"
#: npc/re/merchants/guild_warehouse.txt#23 (mes)
- "The guild storage is only available for guild members."
+ "O armazém do clã só pode ser usado por membros do clã."
#: npc/re/merchants/guild_warehouse.txt#25 (mes)
- "[Warehouse Manager]"
+ "[Agente do Armazém]"
#: npc/re/merchants/guild_warehouse.txt#26 (mes)
- "It seems that it is not yet possible for your guild to use the guild warehouse or you do not have access permissions for the warehouse."
+ "Parece que o seu clã ainda não pode usar o armazém, ou você não tem permissão de acesso a ele."
#: npc/re/merchants/guild_warehouse.txt#27 (mes)
- "Please come back after checking the guild skill and the permission to access the warehouse."
+ "Volte depois de conferir a habilidade de clã e a permissão de acesso ao armazém."
#: npc/re/merchants/guild_warehouse.txt#28 (mes)
- "[Warehouse Manager]"
+ "[Agente do Armazém]"
#: npc/re/merchants/guild_warehouse.txt#29 (mes)
- "I will show you the usage history of the warehouse. Usage history will be retained for up to 3 months."
+ "Vou mostrar o histórico de uso do armazém. O histórico fica guardado por até 3 meses."
#: npc/re/merchants/guild_warehouse.txt#30 (mes)
- "Have a memorable time!"
+ "Aproveite!"

### npc/re/other/bulletin_boards.txt  (10 textos)
#: npc/re/other/bulletin_boards.txt#1 (mes)
- "[Izlude: The Satellite City]"
+ "[Izlude: A Cidade Satélite]"
#: npc/re/other/bulletin_boards.txt#2 (mes)
- "Welcome to Izlude, the satellite of Prontera. Izlude was built to support Prontera's defense and to accomodate its burgeoning population."
+ "Bem-vindo a Izlude, a cidade satélite de Prontera. Izlude foi construída para apoiar a defesa de Prontera e para acomodar a sua população crescente."
#: npc/re/other/bulletin_boards.txt#3 (mes)
- "[Izlude: The Satellite City]"
+ "[Izlude: A Cidade Satélite]"
#: npc/re/other/bulletin_boards.txt#4 (mes)
- "The main buildings here are to accomodate the growth of the Cryptura Academy."
+ "Os principais prédios daqui servem para acomodar o crescimento da Academia Criatura."
#: npc/re/other/bulletin_boards.txt#5 (mes)
- "[Izlude: The Satellite City]"
+ "[Izlude: A Cidade Satélite]"
#: npc/re/other/bulletin_boards.txt#6 (mes)
- "Points of interest include the Swordman Association building which allows adventurers to change their job to Swordman, and the Battle Area that is East of Izlude."
+ "Entre os pontos de interesse estão o prédio da Associação dos Espadachins, onde aventureiros podem se tornar Espadachins, e a Arena, a leste de Izlude."
#: npc/re/other/bulletin_boards.txt#7 (mes)
- "[Izlude: The Satellite City]"
+ "[Izlude: A Cidade Satélite]"
#: npc/re/other/bulletin_boards.txt#8 (mes)
- "At the docks, you may take a ship and travel to ^003399Alberta^000000 or ^660000Byalan Island^000000."
+ "No porto você pode pegar um navio para ^003399Alberta^000000 ou para a ^660000Ilha Byalan^000000."
#: npc/re/other/bulletin_boards.txt#9 (mes)
- "[Izlude: The Satellite City]"
+ "[Izlude: A Cidade Satélite]"
#: npc/re/other/bulletin_boards.txt#10 (mes)
- "From Izlude, ^3355FFProntera^000000 is located to the Northwest, and ^006600Payon^000000 is located to the South. Enjoy your travels in the Rune-Midgarts Kingdom."
+ "De Izlude, ^3355FFProntera^000000 fica a noroeste e ^006600Payon^000000 fica ao sul. Boa viagem pelo Reino de Rune-Midgard."

