- "What would you like to learn about master?"
+ "O que o mestre quer aprender?"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#237 (select)
- "The path of a novice adventurer!"
+ "O caminho do aventureiro novato!"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#238 (select)
- "I want to help people around me."
+ "Quero ajudar as pessoas à minha volta."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#239 (select)
- "I don't like the set path."
+ "Não gosto de caminho pronto."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#240 (select)
- "There is no place I want to go."
+ "Não tem nenhum lugar aonde eu queira ir."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#241 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#242 (mes)
- "I think I saw one ^0000cd<Thinking Archer>^000000 teacher near the entrance to Izlude, but he seemed to have a lot of thoughts. Why don't you go and ask what's going on? Let's go, let's go~"
+ "Acho que vi um professor, o ^0000cd<Arqueiro Pensativo>^000000, perto da entrada de Izlude, mas ele parecia com muita coisa na cabeça. Que tal ir perguntar o que está acontecendo? Vamos, vamos~"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#243 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#244 (mes)
- "Why don't you meet Paul and Anne at the outside ^0000cdProntera's West Gate ^000000? As I was passing by, I heard that they needed help."
+ "Que tal encontrar o Paul e a Anne do lado de fora do ^0000cdPortão Oeste de Prontera ^000000? Quando eu passei por lá, ouvi que eles precisavam de ajuda."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#245 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#246 (mes)
- "Or why not listen to the anxious middle-aged man in ^0000cdPayon^000000?"
+ "Ou que tal ouvir aquele senhor aflito em ^0000cdPayon^000000?"
