#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#445 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#446 (mes)
- "Master, do you know that conversation isn't just about words? Appropriate use of emotion makes the conversation richer."
+ "Mestre, sabia que conversa não é só feita de palavras? Usar a emoção certa deixa a conversa mais rica."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#447 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#448 (mes)
- "Yes. Call me again if you need me."
+ "Isso. Me chame de novo se precisar."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#449 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#450 (mes)
- "Master doesn't want to succeed? Salty says she's training hard because she wants to succeed."
+ "O mestre não quer evoluir? A Salty diz que está treinando muito porque quer evoluir."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#451 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#452 (mes)
- "The tradition is ^0000cdbeing born again in Valhalla and returning to Novice^000000. But it's not a normal Novice, it's called a High Novice."
+ "A tradição é ^0000cdrenascer em Valhalla e voltar a ser Aprendiz^000000. Mas não um Aprendiz comum: é o chamado Aprendiz Transcendental."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#453 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#454 (mes)
- "In other words, it's evolution. People who have passed down say that there are many advantages to getting the job of the past again."
+ "Ou seja, é uma evolução. Quem já passou por isso diz que refazer a classe de antes tem muitas vantagens."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#455 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#456 (mes)
- "There are many statuses, and above all, if you have a secondary job, you can increase your ^0000cdjob level to 70^000000. You will be able to use more skills."
+ "Os atributos são muitos e, acima de tudo, numa segunda classe dá para subir o ^0000cdnível de classe até 70^000000. Você vai poder usar mais habilidades."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#457 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#458 (mes)
- "If you want to succeed, find a person named"
+ "Se quiser evoluir, procure uma pessoa chamada"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#459 (mes)
- "<NAVI>[Metheus Sylph]<INFO>yuno_in02,88,164,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI> ^0000cdat Sage Academy in Yuno^000000, and he will guide you."
+ "<NAVI>[Metheus Sylph]<INFO>yuno_in02,88,164,0,101,0</INFO></NAVI> ^0000cdna Academia de Sábios de Juno^000000, e ele vai te orientar."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#460 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#461 (mes)
- "If you're not interested in transcending, you can just change jobs. But he said that it's better to pass it on when you think about the future."
+ "Se não tiver interesse em transcender, dá para só mudar de classe. Mas dizem que, pensando no futuro, é melhor transcender."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#462 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#463 (mes)
- "If you are not interested in changing jobs or transcending..."
+ "Se não tiver interesse nem em mudar de classe nem em transcender..."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#464 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#465 (mes)
- "The continent is full of festivals all year round. How about participating in the festival when master is also free?"
+ "O continente tem festival o ano inteiro. Que tal participar de um festival quando o mestre estiver livre?"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#466 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#467 (mes)
- "Now..."
+ "Agora..."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#468 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#469 (mes)
- "I heard that there will be a winter hunting contest hosted by the royal family at the royal palace! I want to do a hunting contest! I want to do it! Fight monsters!!! Let's go to Prontera!!!!"
+ "Ouvi dizer que vai ter um torneio de caça de inverno organizado pela família real, no palácio! Eu quero participar do torneio! Quero sim! Lutar com monstros!!! Vamos para Prontera!!!!"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#470 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#471 (mes)
- "I'll definitely take you with me, okay?"
+ "Você me leva junto, com certeza, tá?"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#472 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#473 (mes)
- "Master, I'll tell you the basics, but literally just the basics."
+ "Mestre, vou te contar o básico, mas é o básico mesmo."
