- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#494 (mes)
- "^0000cdMidgard Continent^000000 is said to have the greatest influence of the three kingdoms of Arunafelts, Schwaldzwald, and Rune-Midgarts. Each continent has an airship you can readily use."
+ "Dizem que o ^0000cdContinente de Midgard^000000 é dominado por três reinos: Arunafeltz, Schwarzwald e Rune-Midgard. Cada um tem um Aeroplano que você pode usar à vontade."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#495 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#496 (mes)
- "^0000cdRune-Midgarts^000000. A kingdom ruled by seven royal families and the power of magic prevails."
+ "^0000cdRune-Midgard^000000. Um reino governado por sete famílias reais, onde o poder da magia prevalece."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#497 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#498 (mes)
- "The capital is Prontera, the satellite city of Izlude, Geffen where wizards gather, Payon to the east, Alberta where you can go travel to different regions, Aldebaran with the clock tower, and Morroc."
+ "A capital é Prontera; tem a cidade satélite de Izlude, Geffen, onde os magos se reúnem, Payon a leste, Alberta, de onde se viaja para outras regiões, Al De Baran, com a torre do relógio, e Morroc."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#499 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#500 (mes)
- "We met at Izlude in Rune-Midgarts Kingdom. Remember? Also Payon with Salty, and Paros from where I left. They're all in Rune-Midgats."
+ "A gente se conheceu em Izlude, no Reino de Rune-Midgard. Lembra? E também Payon, com a Salty, e Paros, de onde eu saí. Fica tudo em Rune-Midgard."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#501 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#502 (mes)
- "^0000cdArunafelz^000000. This is a church that worships a goddess. So, there is a Pope. Of course, you can't meet anyone, but is it possible? Maybe we can meet at least once."
+ "^0000cdArunafeltz^000000. É uma igreja que venera uma deusa. Então tem um Papa. Claro que não dá para encontrar qualquer um, mas será que dá? Quem sabe a gente consegue encontrar pelo menos uma vez."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#503 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#504 (mes)
- "Arunafelz has a temple capital, Rachel, and a canyon town, Veins."
+ "Arunafeltz tem Rachel, a capital dos templos, e Veins, a cidade do cânion."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#505 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#506 (mes)
- "^0000cdSchwaldzwald^000000 Republic. As the name suggests, there is a president. The capital city, Yuno, is floating in the air, so it's worth a visit. It must be spectacular."
+ "República de ^0000cdSchwarzwald^000000. Como o nome diz, tem um presidente. A capital, Juno, flutua no ar, então vale a visita. Deve ser espetacular."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#507 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#508 (mes)
- "And there is Lighthalzen, where the headquarters of Rekenberg is located, there is the mining town of Einbroch, the mines of Einbech, and there is also the rural village of Hugel."
+ "E tem Lighthalzen, onde fica a sede da Rekenber, a cidade mineira de Einbroch, as minas de Einbech, e ainda o vilarejo rural de Hugel."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#509 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#510 (mes)
- "There are other Utan villages such as Umbala, or Niflheim, the land of the dead. It's a place I've always wanted to visit!"
+ "Tem também outros vilarejos, como Umbala, dos Utan, ou Nifflheim, a terra dos mortos. É um lugar que eu sempre quis visitar!"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#511 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#512 (mes)
- "Many people thought that there was only the continent of Midgard on this land, but one day, people appeared in the form of ^0000cdcats^000000. No one knew where they came from."
+ "Muita gente achava que nesta terra só existia o continente de Midgard, mas um dia apareceram umas pessoas com forma de ^0000cdgato^000000. Ninguém sabia de onde tinham vindo."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#513 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#514 (mes)
- "These people, called Doram, are from a place far across the sea, the ^0000cdFar-Star Continent^000000. They said that the road was opened for them only recently."
+ "Essas pessoas, chamadas Dorams, vêm de um lugar muito além do mar, o ^0000cdContinente da Estrela Distante^000000. Dizem que o caminho se abriu para eles há pouco tempo."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#515 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#516 (mes)
- "In the Far-Star Continent, the port city ^0000cdLasagna^000000 is the most famous. I want to go there too."
+ "No Continente da Estrela Distante, a cidade portuária de ^0000cdLasagna^000000 é a mais famosa. Eu também quero ir lá."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#517 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#518 (mes)
- "To get here, take the boat from Malangdo or Izlude. Do you remember where we got off?"
+ "Para chegar lá, pegue o barco em Malangdo ou em Izlude. Lembra onde a gente desembarcou?"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#519 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#520 (mes)
- "You've seen people in the form of cats, called Dorams, who come and go. They haven't had their first contact with this Midgard continent, but now they have taken root and established themselves everywhere."
+ "Você já viu umas pessoas com forma de gato, chamadas Dorams, indo e vindo. O primeiro contato deles com o continente de Midgard foi há pouco, mas agora já criaram raízes e se estabeleceram por toda parte."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#521 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#522 (mes)
- "It turns out that while sailing in a faraway place called the Far-Star continent, they met a storm and fell to a place called Malangdo. Literally, the ship fell from the sky."
+ "Parece que, navegando num lugar distante chamado Continente da Estrela Distante, eles pegaram uma tempestade e caíram num lugar chamado Malangdo. O navio caiu do céu, literalmente."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#523 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#524 (mes)
- "Dorams have a lot of magical talents, so if you go to ^0000cdMalangdo^000000 you will have a good time."
+ "Os Dorams têm muito talento para magia, então, se for a ^0000cdMalangdo^000000, você vai se divertir."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#525 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#526 (mes)
- "^0000cdYou can take the boat^000000 from Izlude. If you have Canned Malangdo that can be obtained in a special way, you can use it to travel to there."
+ "^0000cdDá para pegar o barco^000000 em Izlude. Se tiver Peixes Enlatados de Malangdo, que se conseguem de um jeito especial, dá para usá-los para viajar até lá."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#527 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#528 (mes)
- "If you want to feel the atmosphere of a foreign country, you should go to that ^0000cdlocal region^000000. ^0000cdIf you go to Alberta's dock^000000, you can meet the sailors who send people to each local region."
+ "Se quiser sentir o clima de um país estrangeiro, vá a uma dessas ^0000cdregiões distantes^000000. ^0000cdNo porto de Alberta^000000 você encontra os marinheiros que levam as pessoas para cada região."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#529 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#530 (mes)
- "Amatsu, Kunlun, Moscovia, Brasilis, Ayothaya, Dewata, Port Malaya, Rock Ridge, etc. The unknown world is waiting for you."
+ "Amatsu, Kunlun, Moscóvia, Brasilis, Ayothaya, Dewata, Porto Malaya, Rockridge e outros. O mundo desconhecido está te esperando."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#531 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#532 (mes)
- "Doesn't it make your heart flutter just by hearing the words? See you later, master."
+ "Não dá um frio na barriga só de ouvir? Até mais, mestre."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#533 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#534 (mes)
- "Uh, I know, here. If you go through the eastern part of Morroc or talk to Agent Catson in Paradise, they'll send you there."
+ "Ah, eu sei, aqui. Se passar pela parte leste de Morroc, ou falar com o Agente Catson no Grupo do Éden, eles te mandam para lá."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#535 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#536 (mes)
- "You can meet people you've never seen before."
+ "Você vai conhecer gente que nunca viu antes."
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#537 (mes)
- "[Shorty]"
+ "[Shorty]"
#: npc/re/quests/HelpMeShorty.txt#538 (mes)
- "From the base of the Expeditionary Forces of the Three Kingdoms, you can go to Splendid, Eclage, Manuk or El Dicastes."
+ "Da base do Acampamento da Expedição da Aliança dá para ir a Esplendor, Eclage, Manuka ou El Dicastes."
