### npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt  (45 textos)
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#1 (mes)
- "[Edgar]"
+ "[Edgar]"
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#2 (mes)
- "So are you heading to Alberta again? Let me give you the same discount and only charge 250 Zeny, just like the last time."
+ "Vai para Alberta de novo? Te faço o mesmo desconto e cobro só 250 zeny, igual à última vez."
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#3 (mes)
- "How's that sound?"
+ "Que tal?"
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#4 (select)
- "Alrighty~!:Why are you being so nice to me?!"
+ "Beleza~!:Por que você é tão bonzinho comigo?!"
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#5 (mes)
- "[Edgar]"
+ "[Edgar]"
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#6 (mes)
- "Um..."
+ "Hum..."
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#7 (mes)
- "This isn't"
+ "Isso não"
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#8 (mes)
- "enough money."
+ "dá."
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#9 (mes)
- "Why don't you go"
+ "Por que não vai"
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#10 (mes)
- "get some more cash?"
+ "arrumar mais dinheiro?"
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#12 (mes)
- "[Edgar]"
+ "[Edgar]"
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#13 (mes)
- "It's just the way I am. That, and your devilish smile reminds me of my beloved blond haired son who left home years ago to become a Sailor on his own ship. Bless his soul, wherever he is."
+ "É o meu jeito. E também porque esse seu sorriso endiabrado me lembra o meu querido filho loiro, que saiu de casa anos atrás para ser marinheiro no próprio navio. Que Deus o proteja, onde quer que esteja."
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#14 (mes)
- "[Edgar]"
+ "[Edgar]"
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#15 (mes)
- "My town, Izlude, is connected to Alberta by the harbor in the West. There is so much traffic between us, I almost become an Albertian.  Hehehe~"
+ "A minha cidade, Izlude, é ligada a Alberta pelo porto do oeste. O vaivém entre as duas é tanto que eu quase virei albertano. Hehehe~"
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#16 (mes)
- "[Edgar]"
+ "[Edgar]"
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#17 (mes)
- "There's this guy I know pretty well, Phelix, who lives in Alberta. That guy is really stingy... He charges for everything!"
+ "Tem um sujeito que eu conheço bem, o Phelix, que mora em Alberta. Esse cara é muito pão-duro... Cobra por tudo!"
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#18 (mes)
- "[Edgar]"
+ "[Edgar]"
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#19 (mes)
- "But he's really a nice guy and likes helping other people. He has a good heart and will give you his support if you meet his price."
+ "Mas ele é gente boa e gosta de ajudar os outros. Tem bom coração e te dá uma força se você pagar o preço dele."
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#20 (mes)
- "[Edgar]"
+ "[Edgar]"
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#21 (mes)
- "Lately, people in Alberta say that he is really trying to help folks and that his demand for Jellopies is just a coverup.  Well, you should take a look at what he has to offer."
+ "Ultimamente o pessoal de Alberta anda dizendo que ele quer mesmo ajudar e que essa história de pedir Jellopy é só fachada. Bom, vale a pena ver o que ele tem a oferecer."
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#22 (select)
- "Can you tell me how to get to Alberta?:End Conversation"
+ "Pode me dizer como chegar a Alberta?:Encerrar conversa"
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#23 (mes)
- "[Edgar]"
+ "[Edgar]"
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#24 (mes)
- "Huh? Well, you can use your feet and just walk.  But if you have money, I'd like to suggest that you take a ship."
+ "Hein? Bom, dá para ir a pé. Mas, se tiver dinheiro, eu sugiro pegar um navio."
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#25 (select)
- "Okay, gotcha.:But I'm sick of walking and I'm broke!"
+ "Certo, entendi.:Mas eu cansei de andar e estou duro!"
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#26 (mes)
- "[Edgar]"
+ "[Edgar]"
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#27 (mes)
- "Alrighty, take care~"
+ "Beleza, se cuida~"
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#28 (mes)
- "[Edgar]"
+ "[Edgar]"
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#29 (mes)
- "Okay..."
+ "Tá..."
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#30 (mes)
- "You don't want to walk AND you've got no cash, but you still want to go there? Oh geez..."
+ "Não quer andar E está sem dinheiro, mas ainda quer ir para lá? Ai, ai..."
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#31 (mes)
- "[Edgar]"
+ "[Edgar]"
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#32 (mes)
- "Fine fine. Me, being the captain of a ship, can afford to bring you there at a lower price. How does 250 Zeny sound?"
+ "Tá bom, tá bom. Como sou capitão de navio, posso te levar por um preço mais baixo. Que tal 250 zeny?"
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#33 (select)
- "Alrighty~!:Bah, what a rip off!!"
+ "Beleza~!:Ah, que roubo!!"
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#34 (mes)
- "[Edgar]"
+ "[Edgar]"
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#35 (mes)
- "Um..."
+ "Hum..."
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#36 (mes)
- "This isn't"
+ "Isso não"
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#37 (mes)
- "enough money."
+ "dá."
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#38 (mes)
- "Go and get"
+ "Vai lá arrumar"
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#39 (mes)
- "some more."
+ "mais um pouco."
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#41 (mes)
- "[Edgar]"
+ "[Edgar]"
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#42 (mes)
- "Boy oh boy,"
+ "Puxa vida,"
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#43 (mes)
- "if you think"
+ "se você acha"
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#44 (mes)
- "that's a rip off..."
+ "que isso é roubo..."
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#45 (mes)
- "[Edgar]"
+ "[Edgar]"
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#46 (mes)
- "Yeah, alright."
+ "Tá, beleza."
#: npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt#47 (mes)
- "See you later~"
+ "Até mais~"

