#: npc/re/cities/malangdo.txt#10 (mes)
- "The fresh air of Payon is not bad, but why don't you go better place like the heaven of the cats, ^A2314BMalangdo^000000?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/cities/malangdo.txt#11 (mes)
- "The beautiful and quiet place is better than Aldebaran, where it's so noisy with the tick-tock sound of the clock."
+ ""
#: npc/re/cities/malangdo.txt#12 (mes)
- "The beautiful and quiet place is better than Morocc, with its heat and sandstorms."
+ ""
#: npc/re/cities/malangdo.txt#13 (mes)
- "The beautiful place is better than Juno, which is full of books and headaches."
+ ""
#: npc/re/cities/malangdo.txt#14 (mes)
- "The complex place is better than Rachel, where it's too horribly quiet."
+ ""
#: npc/re/cities/malangdo.txt#15 (mes)
- "The safe place is better than Lighthalzen, which is too dangerous."
+ ""
#: npc/re/cities/malangdo.txt#16 (mes)
- "The smell of this sea place is better than Mora, which is full of a grassy smell."
