- "[Alliance Manager]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#78 (mes)
- "We shouldn't loose anything to them,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#79 (mes)
- "no way! We are not as powerful as"
