#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#723 (mes)
- "[Member of Alliance]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#724 (mes)
- "The heads of the alliance, Sikaiz and Munkenro..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#725 (mes)
- "[Member of Alliance]"
