#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#728 (mes)
- "[Member of Alliance]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#729 (mes)
- "Friendship is the most valuable in this world."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#730 (mes)
- "-You're still here? You're a member of the alliance now so you should head to the dimensional rift next to Morocc and find the Guard there-"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#731 (mes)
- "[Member of Alliance]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#732 (mes)
- "I know we are all to go to the dimensional rift. That's why we are allied strongly. But we gather here... so far from there..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#733 (mes)
- "[Member of Alliance]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#734 (mes)
- "I think we'd better gather in Prontera on Rune-Midgarts, where I am living."
