+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#756 (mes)
- "-I'm so bored!!! You should be heading to the dimensional rift next to Morocc and find the Guard there. It's probably less boring there than it is here-"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#757 (mes)
- "[Member of Alliance]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#758 (mes)
- "I am almost dying of boredom!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#759 (mes)
- "[Member of Alliance]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#760 (mes)
- "So boring!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#761 (mes)
- "[Member of Alliance]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#762 (mes)
- "I am not in a good mood."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#763 (mes)
- "-We haven't even started and we're already bickering. Just ignore the politics and head to the dimensional rift next to Morocc and find the Guard there-"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#764 (mes)
- "[Member of Alliance]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#765 (mes)
- "Three kingdoms for world peace..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#766 (mes)
- "Will it be successful?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#767 (mes)
- "-You shouldn't stay around here and listen to all the complaining. You should be heading to the dimensional rift next to Morocc and find the Guard there-"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#768 (mes)
- "[Member of Alliance]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#769 (mes)
- "Why is there so much complaining?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#770 (mes)
- "[Member of Alliance]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#771 (mes)
- "I'm going along for the benefit of my country."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#772 (mes)
- "[Member of Alliance]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#773 (mes)
- "I wonder if the managers are all talk."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#774 (mes)
- "[Manager]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#775 (mes)
- "With blessings from the Goddess Freya! We three kingdoms will know success! It's all we want. ...Khkhkhkh..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#776 (mes)
- "[Manager]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#777 (mes)
- "What brings you here, if you won't worship Freya? Just go away."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#778 (mes)
- "[Manager]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#779 (mes)
- "Hm, you've come here to report the status of the alliance? Ok, let me listen."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#780 (mes)
- "[Manager]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#781 (mes)
- "Hm, everything is going well"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#782 (mes)
- "and almost prepared for a good start... Hm-hmm..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#783 (mes)
- "[Manager]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#784 (mes)
- "I hate to meet people from Rune-Midgarts, but I can't avoid it."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#785 (mes)
- "[Manager]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#786 (mes)
- "We're all together for this mission now... They would sacrifice for Freya."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#787 (mes)
- "[Manager]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#788 (mes)
- "Now you can go back."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#789 (mes)
- "Just say I received the report of the status well."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#790 (mes)
- "[Manager]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#791 (mes)
- "Goddess Freya, keep us forever!!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#792 (mes)
- "[Manager]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#793 (mes)
- "Ash-Vacuum..."
