+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2161 (mes)
- "[Monster Scholar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2162 (mes)
- "Oh, I'm sorry."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2163 (mes)
- "You don't have to tell"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2164 (mes)
- "me if you don't want to..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2165 (mes)
- "[Monster Scholar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2166 (mes)
- "Please go ahead and do"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2167 (mes)
- "what you have to do."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2168 (mes)
- "Oh, me? Don't worry."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2169 (mes)
- "I'm fine by myself."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2170 (select)
- "Who are you?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2171 (mes)
- "[Monster Scholar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2172 (mes)
- "I'm Rumis Block, and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2173 (mes)
- "I'm working here on behalf of"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2174 (mes)
- "the monsternomics academy"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2175 (mes)
- "from the Schwarzwald Republic."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2176 (mes)
- "Botanist Terris Block is"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2177 (mes)
- "my older twin brother."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2178 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2179 (mes)
- "This place is freezing. Not only"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2180 (mes)
- "that, it's deserted and too"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2181 (mes)
- "quiet... Everything around us is"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2182 (mes)
- "watching and threatening us."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2183 (mes)
- "You know, I didn't want to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2184 (mes)
- "come here..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2185 (select)
- "How did you get here?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2186 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2187 (mes)
- "In fact, none of us"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2188 (mes)
- "wanted to come here."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2189 (mes)
- "I mean, no one knows"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2190 (mes)
- "what kind of danger lurks"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2191 (mes)
- "in this unknown world."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2192 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2193 (mes)
- "It was my brother Terris who"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2194 (mes)
- "wanted me to come along."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2195 (mes)
- "He was selected first as the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2196 (mes)
- "botanist of the continental"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2197 (mes)
- "expedition. He had to drag me"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2198 (mes)
- "here 'cuz I didn't want to come."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2199 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2200 (mes)
- "I guess he didn't want to be"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2201 (mes)
- "alone in this world far away"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2202 (mes)
- "from civilization. Instead, he"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2203 (mes)
- "decided to drag me here and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2204 (mes)
- "force me to join the expedition"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2205 (mes)
- "so he doesn't feel lonely!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2206 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2207 (mes)
- "What's with that dirty look?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2208 (mes)
- "Why, do I sound like"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2209 (mes)
- "someone blaming someone"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2210 (mes)
- "else for the misery in his life?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2211 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2212 (mes)
- "I'm telling you, it's the truth."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2213 (mes)
- "There are people that want "
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2214 (mes)
- "to escape the expedition by"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2215 (mes)
- "getting themselves sick on purpose."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2216 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2217 (mes)
- "I know it's too late to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2218 (mes)
- "complain now, but..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2219 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2220 (mes)
- "Every day I pray to God to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2221 (mes)
- "let me go back home safely."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2222 (mes)
- "That's the only thing that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2223 (mes)
- "keeps me going. Everything"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2224 (mes)
- "around here is watching me."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2225 (mes)
- "It's suffocating, you know?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2226 (select)
- "When do you go back?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2227 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2228 (mes)
- "That's the problem."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2229 (mes)
- "We Specialists are required"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2230 (mes)
- "to submit our study reports"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2231 (mes)
- "to the expedition's leaders."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2232 (mes)
- "We are here to explore"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2233 (mes)
- "and study this world."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2234 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2235 (mes)
- "I'm sure the management will"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2236 (mes)
- "tell me when to go back, but"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2237 (mes)
- "I don't expect it to be any time"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2238 (mes)
- "soon. It'll be at least after"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2239 (mes)
- "I submit my report."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2240 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2241 (mes)
- "I must tell you,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2242 (mes)
- "I hate this place!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2243 (mes)
- "It gives me the creeps!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2244 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2245 (mes)
- "Yes, I'm a monster scholar"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2246 (mes)
- "But I've been afraid of creatures even when I was on the Midgard Continent..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2247 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2248 (mes)
- "No, but can't you see?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2249 (mes)
- "This place is totally new to me,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2250 (mes)
- "and everything is so unknown..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2251 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2252 (mes)
- "I may be a monster scholar,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2253 (mes)
- "but I'm afraid..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2254 (mes)
- "Of many things..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2255 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2256 (mes)
- "The president of United"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2257 (mes)
- "Midgard Corporation has"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2258 (mes)
- "asked me to find some"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2259 (mes)
- "monsters that are edible."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2260 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2261 (mes)
- "But look outside. Look!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2262 (mes)
- "Do you see Mandragoras"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2263 (mes)
- "hiding in the icy bushes?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2264 (mes)
- "Those are called ^3131FFNepentheses^000000."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2265 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2266 (mes)
- "Aren't they quite savage-"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2267 (mes)
- "looking and intimidating?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2268 (mes)
- "They look as if they"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2269 (mes)
- "want to sting me with"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2270 (mes)
- "those sharp thorns!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2271 (mes)
- "Argh..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2272 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2273 (mes)
- "I'd rather starve to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2274 (mes)
- "death than study"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2275 (mes)
- "those dangerous and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2276 (mes)
- "grotesque monsters!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2277 (mes)
- "I'm not going to go"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2278 (mes)
- "outside of my tent."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2279 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2280 (mes)
- "Not ever."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2281 (mes)
- "No one can dare"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2282 (mes)
- "venture through"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2283 (mes)
- "such a threatening"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2284 (mes)
- "environment!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2285 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2286 (mes)
- "I'm not going to go"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2287 (mes)
- "outside of my tent."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2288 (mes)
- "Not ever."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2289 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2290 (mes)
- "I'm scared of this place."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2291 (mes)
- "But I'm not going to ask"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2292 (mes)
- "my brother for help"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2293 (mes)
- "He hates me."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2294 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2295 (mes)
- "If a Nepenthes"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2296 (mes)
- "approaches me"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2297 (mes)
- "with a smile and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2298 (mes)
- "speaks to me kindly..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2299 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2300 (mes)
- "*Sigh* I sound crazy, don't I?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2301 (mes)
- "...This is why I didn't want"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2302 (mes)
- "to leave my lab..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2303 (select)
- "Show loot from Nepentheses.:Scold him.:Comfort him."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2304 (mes)
- "["
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2305 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2306 (mes)
- "Hey, take a look here..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2307 (mes)
- "These Nepentheses aren't"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2308 (mes)
- "any more brutal or grotesque"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2309 (mes)
- "than the ones back home."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2310 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2311 (mes)
- "...What's this?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2312 (mes)
- "Isn't this from"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2313 (mes)
- "the Nepentheses?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2314 (mes)
- "["
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2315 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2316 (mes)
- "That's right!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2317 (mes)
- "I took care of them."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2318 (mes)
- "It was easy, haha!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2319 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2320 (mes)
- "I can't believe you really"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2321 (mes)
- "took care of them! Tell me,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2322 (mes)
- "who are you really?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2323 (mes)
- "Are you a soldier?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2324 (mes)
- "Captain? Or agent?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2325 (mes)
- "["
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2326 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2327 (mes)
- "No, I'm just a wandering"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2328 (mes)
- "adventurer. I've come here"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2329 (mes)
- "to challenge this new place"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2330 (mes)
- "and to help people out~"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2331 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2332 (mes)
- "I... I see."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2333 (mes)
- "I've heard about adventurers"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2334 (mes)
- "that have made positive"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2335 (mes)
- "impacts on Midgard."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2336 (mes)
- "You're one of them, huh?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2337 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2338 (mes)
- "...That's great!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2339 (mes)
- "I think I've finally found"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2340 (mes)
- "a silver lining. God has"
