#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2552 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2553 (mes)
- "..."
+ "..."
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2554 (mes)
- ", I thank you so much for helping me despite my self-centered behavior."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2555 (mes)
- "I really appreciate it"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2556 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2557 (mes)
- "I'll repay your favor as soon as I go back home."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2558 (mes)
- "I hope you'll make yourself known in Ash Vacuum with your great accomplishments."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2559 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2560 (mes)
- "Can you please go check what kind of races reside at the end of the land over the rightward bridge? I want to know if they're friendly or hostile to us."
