#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2561 (mes)
- "["
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2562 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2563 (mes)
- "Mr. Rumis! Take a look at this!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2564 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2565 (mes)
- "...Oh, hello."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2566 (mes)
- "I'm extremely frustrated. I feel helpless because I wasn't able to go back home last time..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2567 (mes)
- "["
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2568 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2569 (mes)
- "I've found this horn from a monster in the Splendide Area."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2570 (mes)
- "That monster was very mysterious, and its body was covered with grass."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2571 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2572 (mes)
- "Ho... Covered with grass?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2573 (mes)
- "...I know you're excited, but that doesn't sound interesting to me. Sorry."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2574 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2575 (mes)
- "Let me take a look at the horn."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2576 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2577 (mes)
- "Hmm."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2578 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2579 (mes)
- "Uhmm..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2580 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2581 (mes)
- "Huh...?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2582 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2583 (mes)
- "...This is remarkable."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2584 (mes)
- "...This horn looks very similar to that of the Hillsrions that inhabit the Manuk area."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2585 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2586 (mes)
- "I wonder if they're related,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2587 (mes)
- "or if this is an evolved Hillsrion."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2588 (mes)
- "["
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2589 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2590 (mes)
- "Ah, and there's the possibility of mutation caused by the environment."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2591 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2592 (mes)
- "...What do you mean?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2593 (mes)
- "Are you saying the monster has been mutated by environmental causes?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2594 (mes)
- "["
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2595 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2596 (mes)
- "Well, that's possible, isn't it? Haha!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2597 (mes)
- "- You told Rumis what you've heard from Botanist Terris: some plants are already showing signs of mutation. -"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2598 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2599 (mes)
- "Oh, that's interesting."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2600 (mes)
- "If such a device really exists, it's possible to cause abnormal growth to monsters by injecting them with special energy."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2601 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2602 (mes)
- "By the way, who came up with the idea of that device?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2603 (mes)
- "["
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2604 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2605 (mes)
- "I have no idea. Haha!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2606 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2607 (mes)
- "I see..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2608 (mes)
- "Mutants caused by a man-made device... Then there might be more mutated creatures in addition to Tendrillion."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2609 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2610 (mes)
- "...Now I'm very curious."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2611 (mes)
- "But... I want to go back home... It's no use studying them if the management will order me to return."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2612 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2613 (mes)
- "I guess my brother really likes this place."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2614 (mes)
- "I mean, he's working so hard to figure things out..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2615 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2616 (mes)
- "Well, not everyone can live the same life."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2617 (mes)
- "I just hope he'll have a better understanding about me..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2618 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2619 (mes)
- "I don't know if people in Midgard will welcome me back."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2620 (mes)
- "Thanks to you, I at least have a few interesting stories to tell them."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2621 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2622 (mes)
- "If you're going to stick around here longer, please help my brother with his study."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2623 (mes)
- "I might want to come back later once this area is fully explored and developed..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2624 (mes)
- "- With a shy smile on the face, Rumis Block asked you to shake hands, and then turned around hurriedly. -"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2625 (mes)
- "- You really hope that Rumis will be able to go back home. -"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2626 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2627 (mes)
- "...I submitted the report to the management, but they have not yet ordered me to go back home..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2628 (mes)
- "...*Sigh* I guess nothing's as easy as I'd hoped."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2629 (mes)
- "- Rumis seems anxious and scatterbrained. -"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2630 (mes)
- "[Rumis Block]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2631 (mes)
- "When can I go back to Midgard...? *Sigh*"
