#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2661 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2662 (mes)
- "I agree. There's so much to see around here!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2663 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2664 (mes)
- "Ahahaha!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2665 (mes)
- "Nice to meet you, my friend."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2666 (mes)
- "So, is there anything I can help you with?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2667 (mes)
- "["
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2668 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2669 (mes)
- "Your brother wanted me to send this to you. Maybe it'll help with your study."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2670 (mes)
- "- You have given the Nepenthes Specimen to the botanist. -"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2671 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2672 (mes)
- "Oh...? Isn't this?!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2673 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2674 (mes)
- "...Well, I've got a ton of samples of this specimen. Sorry."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2675 (mes)
- "- He points at a pile of specimens in the tent. -"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2676 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2677 (mes)
- "Still, I'm impressed. I always thought my brother could never do anything on his own. But look, he was able to collect a Nepenthes specimen."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2678 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2679 (mes)
- "Then again, I had this strong feeling that someone has helped him."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2680 (mes)
- "That someone was probably you, right?~"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2681 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2682 (mes)
- "Either way, I don't care."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2683 (mes)
- "I'm just happy that he cares about me..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2684 (mes)
- "["
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2685 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2686 (mes)
- "Why do you think that?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2687 (mes)
- "Can't you just thank him for trying to help you?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2688 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2689 (mes)
- "Well, you must forget that he and I are twins."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2690 (mes)
- "We are spiritually connected to each other."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2691 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2692 (mes)
- "Usually twins share the same feelings and ideas, I can see what he does or thinks if I try hard."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2693 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2694 (mes)
- "Let me see what Rumis is doing right now... Oh, he's picking his nose with his left hand and eating a slice of bread with his right."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2695 (mes)
- "God, how disgusting!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2696 (select)
- "Go check Rumis if it's true.:Do not trust his word."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2697 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2698 (mes)
- "Hahaha!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2699 (mes)
- "Muhahaha!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2700 (mes)
- "Let me guess, you want to go check Rumis to see if I'm telling the truth. Am I wrong?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2701 (mes)
- "Hahahaha! Sorry, but I lied. I mean, remote vision? Because we're twins?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2702 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2703 (mes)
- "God, you're so funny. Hahaha~"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2704 (mes)
- "You please me, just like the new creatures blooming on the World Tree.~"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2705 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2706 (mes)
- "Oh,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2707 (mes)
- "won't you cut me some slack? I was just joking to melt the ice."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2708 (mes)
- "This world is too barren and tough to live without good humor and jokes, you know?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2709 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2710 (mes)
- "Anyways, as I said, I've got a lot of Nepenthes specimens."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2711 (mes)
- "But I'll gratefully take this pretentious gift of his."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2712 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2713 (mes)
- "This may be an unexpected question, but... Are you interested in meeting dangerous girls playing on a field?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2714 (select)
- "Dangerous girls?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2715 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2716 (mes)
- "Yes, femme fatales!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2717 (mes)
- "I've seen girls that are so beautiful."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2718 (mes)
- "They're too dangerous to get close, but that's what make them so irresistibly attractive. Do you understand what I'm saying?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2719 (select)
- "It's... Hard to say."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2720 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2721 (mes)
- "Have you explored the area over the bridge at the right side of the united expedition camp?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2722 (mes)
- "Then you know the area is so cold that it'll instantly freeze your heart."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2723 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2724 (mes)
- "You should go across the leftward bridge, you'll be surprised to see what's ahead of you."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2725 (mes)
- "It's yet to be known how such a thing can happen."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2726 (select)
- "What are you talking about?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2727 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2728 (mes)
- "Well..."
+ "Bom..."
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2729 (mes)
- "I suppose I don't have the words to really describe such an amazing scene."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2730 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2731 (mes)
- "I'll send a message to the garrison for you. Why don't you go see it with your own eyes? You won't be disappointed!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2732 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2733 (mes)
- "Of course, I'm offering such an extraordinary service because there's something I want in return. Ahahaha!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2734 (mes)
- "...Truth be told, I'm having some trouble. And I need someone to help me."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2735 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2736 (mes)
- "For now, you should go across the leftward bridge. Speak to a guard over there, and then just go ahead."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2737 (mes)
- "A group of beautiful girls will welcome you. I hope you'll enjoy having a conversation with them. Maybe you'll get to understand the mystery of nature."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2738 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2739 (mes)
- "Yes, I only need... ^3131FF30^000000 of them."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2740 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2741 (mes)
- "Welcome back! How was it?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2742 (mes)
- "It was amazing, wasn't it?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2743 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2744 (mes)
- "On the right side of this united expedition camp,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2745 (mes)
- "we have a land surrounded by roaring blizzards."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2746 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2747 (mes)
- "And on the other side,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2748 (mes)
- "we have a peaceful green land"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2749 (mes)
- "where we can enjoy Mother Nature's warm embrace."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2750 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2751 (mes)
- "Two completely different worlds coexist"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2752 (mes)
- "within a short distance of each other."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2753 (mes)
- "Where else can you see such amazing contrasts at a glance?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2754 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2755 (mes)
- "I'm curious to know all secrets about this world."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2756 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2757 (mes)
- "I'm so excited that I can't hide it!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2758 (mes)
- "*Pant Pant*"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2759 (mes)
- "*Pant Pant*"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2760 (select)
- "What a mysterious world this is!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2761 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2762 (mes)
- "Yes, it is..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2763 (mes)
- "Oh, right!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2764 (mes)
- "Actually I'm here to study this strange phenomenon."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2765 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2766 (mes)
- "To understand the environmental conditions,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2767 (mes)
- "including temperature and humidity,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2768 (mes)
- "5.....and check the families and growth of plants,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2769 (mes)
- "I've installed several special environmental meters"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2770 (mes)
- "in this area."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2771 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2772 (mes)
- "Unfortunately, some evil monsters"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2773 (mes)
- "keep destroying the precious meters"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2774 (mes)
- "with their ^3131FFHeinous Hoops^000000!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2775 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2776 (mes)
- "The culprits are called Cornus."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2777 (mes)
- "I'd like to ask you to teach them not to destroy my devices again."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2778 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2779 (mes)
- "How'd you like to hunt ^3131FF10 of them^000000 to set an example? Good luck!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2780 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2781 (mes)
- "For now, you should go across the leftward bridge. Speak to a guard over there, and then just go ahead."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2782 (mes)
- "A group of beautiful girls will welcome you. I hope you'll enjoy having a conversation with them. Maybe you'll get to understand the mystery of nature."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2783 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2784 (mes)
- "Hopefully the Cornuses have learned their lesson, and won't touch my special environmental meters anymore."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2785 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2786 (mes)
- "Oh Karyl, while you were away, I received an interesting report from one of my research machines that remained intact."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2787 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2788 (mes)
- "According to the report, The original weather condition of Ash Vacuum is cold and dry, just like the land on the right side."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2789 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2790 (mes)
- "That means, somebody has artificially cultivated the leftward land."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2791 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2792 (mes)
- "Do you remember seeing strange mushroom shaped buildings everywhere in the fields?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2793 (mes)
- "I suspect it to be an environmental purifier that converts barren land into lush, green fields."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2794 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2795 (mes)
- "Let me show you."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2796 (mes)
- "Please take this rotting plant stem,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2797 (mes)
- "I'll meet you at the environmental purifier standing right next to the leftward bridge on the other side."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2798 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2799 (mes)
- "Cornuses are breaking my special environmental meters!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2800 (mes)
- "Please show them the power of Midgardians!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2801 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2802 (mes)
- "I'll meet you at the environmental purifier standing right next to the leftward bridge on the other side."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2803 (mes)
- "[Botanist]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2804 (mes)
- "I submitted a report to upper management."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#2805 (mes)
- "I haven't received any response, but I'm sure they'll be as excited as I am once they read the report. Woohoo!"
