+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4235 (mes)
- "[Taab]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4236 (mes)
- "Oh, I always wanted to put something warm on the floor for my creatures."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4237 (mes)
- "I was thinking of using fur."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4238 (mes)
- "I can also use fur to cover the cage during rainy days, you know?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4239 (mes)
- "[Taab]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4240 (mes)
- "Can you please bring me ^4d4dff30 scraps of fur^000000?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4241 (mes)
- "It sounds easy, doesn't it?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4242 (mes)
- "I think the fur of Tatachoes and Hillsrions will be perfect."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4243 (mes)
- "[Taab]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4244 (mes)
- "Of course, I'm not going to use them for the cages with the Tatachoes and Hillsrions."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4245 (mes)
- "Those furs will be for the Cornuses."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4246 (mes)
- "[Taab]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4247 (mes)
- "It seems Cornuses love being warm."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4248 (mes)
- "The weather in this area is so strange that I'm having a hard time optimizing the temperature for each kind of creature."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4249 (mes)
- "[Taab]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4250 (mes)
- "Thank you in advance."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4251 (mes)
- "Don't forget the 30 scraps of fur."
