- "[Taab]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4253 (mes)
- "Oh, I'm sorry, but no jobs are available right now."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4254 (mes)
- "Some other part-timers finished all the work."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4255 (mes)
- "[Taab]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4256 (mes)
- "I'm sorry for the trouble I must have caused you to come here. Haha..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4257 (mes)
- "I'll see you next time."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4258 (mes)
- "[Taab]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4259 (mes)
- "Please stay far away from the cages."
