#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4612 (mes)
- "[Cat Paw Agent]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4613 (mes)
- "Thank you for using our service."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4614 (mes)
- "[Cat Paw Agent]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4615 (mes)
- "*Yawn...*"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4616 (mes)
- "I want to eat fish."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4617 (mes)
- "[Cat Paw Agent]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4618 (mes)
- "Don't play with money."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4632 (mes)
- "[Fluffy Gyaruk]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4633 (mes)
- "*Sniff Sniff* Can't you smell fish"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4634 (mes)
- "around here?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4635 (mes)
- "[Fluffy Gyaruk]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4636 (mes)
- "Hmm?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4637 (mes)
- "Oh, did the Cat Paw Agent send you?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4638 (select)
- "Yes."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4639 (mes)
- "[Fluffy Gyaruk]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4640 (mes)
- "Oh, okay..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4641 (mes)
- "Well, where should I begin."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4642 (mes)
- "(Mumble Mumble)"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4643 (select)
- "What do you guys do?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4644 (mes)
- "[Fluffy Gyaruk]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4645 (mes)
- "Oh, sure."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4646 (mes)
- "I can start from there."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4647 (mes)
- "You used Kafra Corporation services on the Midgard Continent, didn't you?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4648 (select)
- "Yes."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4649 (mes)
- "[Fluffy Gyaruk]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4650 (mes)
- "Cat Trading is a new trading company based on this undeveloped continent."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4651 (mes)
- "[Fluffy Gyaruk]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4652 (mes)
- "Well, frankly we wanted to join the Midgard Market, but it was too competitive..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4653 (mes)
- "Not only that, they don't have enough fish for all of us either... (Mumble Mumble)"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4654 (select)
- "What services do you offer?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4655 (mes)
- "[Fluffy Gyaruk]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4656 (mes)
- "*Purr* Oh, our service range is similar to the Kafra's Location Saving, Storage Service, Warp Service, and more."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4657 (mes)
- "[Fluffy Gyaruk]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4658 (mes)
- "The only difference is that, our services are limited depending on the customer's credit."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4659 (select)
- "Credit?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4660 (mes)
- "[Fluffy Gyaruk]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4661 (mes)
- "As you might know already, we're a considerably small company struggling to make ends meet in this niche market."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4662 (mes)
- "We desperately need your support to grow."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4663 (mes)
- "[Fluffy Gyaruk]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4664 (mes)
- "You can increase your credit by helping us secure our food or by collecting minerals."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4665 (mes)
- "[Fluffy Gyaruk]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4666 (mes)
- "The more credits you earn, the more services you can use. You can also apply for special events."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4667 (mes)
- "Say, how'd you like to make a membership contract with us?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4668 (select)
- "Sure.:I need to think it over."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4669 (mes)
- "[Fluffy Gyaruk]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4670 (mes)
- "Excellent! Thank you for joining the Cat Trading membership service."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4671 (mes)
- "We hope you'll support our exploration of this unknown land."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4672 (mes)
- "[Fluffy Gyaruk]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4673 (mes)
- "Please go speak to the Cat Paw Agent over there to use a basic service."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4674 (mes)
- "Oh, and please come back afterwards."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4675 (mes)
- "[Fluffy Gyaruk]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4676 (mes)
- "How disappointing!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4677 (mes)
- "But I understand."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4678 (mes)
- "[Fluffy Gyaruk]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#4679 (mes)
