#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5093 (cutin)
- "ep13_captin_edq"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5094 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5095 (mes)
- "Oh, how was your trip? Hey, you look better than you did when you left. Did you drop by your hometown and enjoy great food or something?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5096 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5097 (mes)
- "So tell me, did you bring the report to all three national leaders? Good job."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5098 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5099 (mes)
- "I understand there were some unforeseen obstacles we didn't anticipate since we thought this mission was pretty trivial, but you still did your best."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5100 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5101 (mes)
- "I must warn you, however, this is not the end of these strange events. You're involved in this situation so deeply that you can't get out of it. Hahaha!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5102 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5103 (mes)
- "Don't worry. I'm not here to fool around. Isn't that right?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5104 (mes)
- "[Staff Officer Abidal]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5105 (mes)
- "Yes, sir. We can't let the same thing happen again."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5106 (mes)
- "[Instructor Igrid]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5107 (mes)
- "I shall find out who's behind this, and destroy him."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5108 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5109 (mes)
- "So... I was hoping that you'll come back and help us once we figure out who's behind this. Will you?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5110 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5111 (mes)
- "And please take this small reward."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5112 (mes)
- "Thank you for your help so far."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5113 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5114 (mes)
- "Then I'll see you next time. Keep yourself in one piece, alright?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5115 (mes)
- "Hahaha!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5116 (cutin)
- "ep13_captin_edq"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5117 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5118 (mes)
- "Hey, how have you been? It's too early to say that we've figured out who's the mastermind."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5119 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5120 (mes)
- "Please be patient, I'll contact you when the time is right."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5121 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5122 (mes)
- "Wait, have you explored this area yet? I mean the wide tundra and fields around the camp."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5123 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5124 (mes)
- "There are many fun things outside. If you are an adventurer, go explore for yourself. Come back after you've explored the areas around the camp."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5125 (cutin)
- "ep13_captin_edq"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5126 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5127 (mes)
- "Ah, it's you again. So, are you accustomed to this area now?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5128 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5129 (mes)
- "What brings you here again? You seem to have something to say to me."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5130 (select)
- "I just want to say hello.:I found a weird portal below the mine cave."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5131 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5132 (mes)
- "Well hello then..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5133 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5134 (mes)
- "Please be patient. I'll contact you when the time is right."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5135 (cutin)
- "ep13_captin_edq"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5136 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5137 (mes)
- "What portal? I've never heard about it."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5138 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5139 (mes)
- "That place must be where both races fight against each other. It might be dangerous there."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5140 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5141 (mes)
- "I have no idea of what it is like. It is not in my field of expertise."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5142 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5143 (mes)
- "There is someone here who can help you. He is a historian from Rune-Midgarts. He may be aware of some relics or something that could help."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5144 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5145 (mes)
- "Find the historian and see if he has any useful information for you."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5146 (cutin)
- "ep13_captin_edq"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5147 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5148 (mes)
- "He's at his post, you can't find him?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5149 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5150 (mes)
- "His name is Magniffer... look for him.. he's somewhere around here..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5151 (cutin)
- "ep13_captin_edq"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5152 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5153 (mes)
- "Did you talk with the scholar? Thesedays, I haven't seen him for a while."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5154 (mes)
- "[Staff Officer Abidal]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5155 (mes)
- "That's because you don't like talking to him."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5156 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5157 (mes)
- "Hey, don't judge me like that...the problem is only that I can't see him often."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5158 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5159 (mes)
- "Whatever. Did something happen because he showed up to me? Tell me more."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5160 (select)
- "Tell the story."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5161 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5162 (mes)
- "Hmmm... umm... so..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5163 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5164 (mes)
- "So, that's why that happened like that... It's so complicated..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5165 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5166 (mes)
- "And you guys...you just take a task that you start up at first."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5167 (mes)
- "[Staff Officer Abidal]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5168 (mes)
- "You sent him to Doctor Magnifer first...."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5169 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5170 (mes)
- "I just thought that he needed someone to talk to."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5171 (mes)
- "[Staff Officer Abidal]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5172 (mes)
- "Ah yeah... you're right."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5173 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5174 (mes)
- "Hmm... for example, you want to investigate a cave that you found, but you got on the Laphine and Sapha's nerves. right?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5175 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5176 (mes)
- "And that two guys pay attention and stay quiet, but they are doing it for themselves.."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5177 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5178 (mes)
- "The most important thing is that this place is the ground that the Yggdrasilberry takes root acording to Magnifer."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5179 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5180 (mes)
- "Abidal, do you have anything to say about this?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5181 (mes)
- "[Staff Officer Abidal]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5182 (mes)
- "Our object is to make contact with one tribe and investgate this world and how adaptable it can be."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5183 (mes)
- "[Staff Officer Abidal]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5184 (mes)
- "Actually, we don't have to make this situation bigger than it already is."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5185 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5186 (mes)
- "Yeah right. I don't want to extend this thing anymore..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5187 (mes)
- "[Staff Officer Abidal]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5188 (mes)
- "But the two tribes have remained neutral towards us up until now."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5189 (mes)
- "[Staff Officer Abidal]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5190 (mes)
- "We don't really know what attitude they have towards us."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5191 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5192 (mes)
- "Yeah.. that makes sense... If they made a general attack, we would probably fail."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5193 (mes)
- "[Staff Officer Abidal]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5194 (mes)
- "We should map out a strategy. There is a method that uses Laphine and Sapha's together."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5195 (mes)
- "[Staff Officer Abidal]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5196 (mes)
- "We send this guy to one of the tribes and ask for cooperation in our investigation."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5197 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5198 (mes)
- "Will they help us? They have already said threatening words..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5199 (mes)
- "[Staff Officer Abidal]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5200 (mes)
- "Of course they will help us. if they reject our demand, we just say that we'll ask for help from the other tribe."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5201 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5202 (mes)
- "Right, if we do that, they will have no other choice."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5203 (mes)
- "[Staff Officer Abidal]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5204 (mes)
- "In this situation, they want to avoid showing that place to the other tribe."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5205 (mes)
- "[Staff Officer Abidal]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5206 (mes)
- "So, they have to cooperate with us."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5207 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5208 (mes)
- "Oh, you have a malicious idea."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5209 (mes)
- "[Staff Officer Abidal]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5210 (mes)
- "That's called that Kuhotanrangjigea from east. I didn't make that by myself."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5211 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5212 (mes)
- "Whatever.. Hey, you there... your name is "
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5213 (mes)
- " right? Do you know what to do?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5214 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5215 (mes)
- "Go to one of the tribes and ask for help officially. I'll send someone to the other tribe."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5216 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5217 (mes)
- "I'm going to give you a choice. Which tribe do you want to go to?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5218 (select)
- "Laphine:Sapha"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5219 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5220 (mes)
- "Okay, then I place responsibility on you. from now on you focus on acquiring a good reputation with the Laphine."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5221 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5222 (mes)
- "It won't be easy to get a good impression from the Sapha again."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5223 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5224 (mes)
- "So you must earn us a good reputation from the Laphine."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5225 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5226 (mes)
- "Will you choose the Laphine?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5227 (select)
- "Choose Laphine.:Think again."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5228 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5229 (mes)
- "Good. You are now responsible with building our relationship with the Laphine tribe."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5230 (mes)
- "[Hibba Agip]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5231 (mes)
- "Go to the chief of the Laphine and if he doesn't accept our request, just say that you are going to ask for help from the Sapha."
+ ""
