#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5549 (mes)
- "[Staff Officer Abidal]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5550 (mes)
- "I heard that you got a new duty from Commander Agip."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5551 (mes)
- "[Staff Officer Abidal]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5552 (mes)
- "...Aren't you leaving? I think you should."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5553 (mes)
- "[Staff Officer Abidal]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5554 (mes)
- "Hello, I'm Staff Officer Abidal. Safe travels, Adventurer."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5555 (mes)
- "[Instructor Igrid]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5556 (mes)
- "Hey, rookies. I guess you were lucky enough to complete the mission."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5557 (mes)
- "[Instructor Igrid]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5558 (mes)
- "This is not the end. Keep yourself in one piece until we need your services again."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5559 (mes)
- "[Instructor Igrid]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5560 (mes)
- "I'm Instructor Igrid of the Midgard Expedition. I'm in charge of training and commanding soldiers."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5561 (mes)
- "[Instructor Igrid]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5562 (mes)
- "You must want to become an official member of our expedition."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5563 (mes)
- "I'm sorry, but you're too weak to endure my intensive training."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5564 (mes)
- "Give up before you get hurt."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5565 (mes)
- "[Instructor Igrid]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5566 (mes)
- "If you have too much time on your hands, look around. There's plenty of chores available for so-called adventurers's like you."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5567 (mes)
- "If you do your best to do them, I might accept you as a trainee on this expedition."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5568 (mes)
- "[Instructor Igrid]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5569 (mes)
- "I don't trust you. Hm. Sorry. I don't really have the right to say that if the commander has assigned you to the mission."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5570 (mes)
- "[Instructor Igrid]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5571 (mes)
- "If you're going to give up, give up now. That'll be better for both of us."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5572 (mes)
- "[Instructor Igrid]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5573 (mes)
- "I knew you couldn't do it. Didn't I tell you to give up when you had the chance?!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5574 (mes)
- "[Instructor Igrid]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5575 (mes)
- "Do you think I'm doing this for you? No, I'm just using this chance to discipline idle soldiers."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5576 (mes)
- "[Instructor Igrid]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5577 (mes)
- "What are you looking at? Go mind your own business!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5578 (mes)
- "[Instructor Igrid]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5579 (mes)
- "I am Expedition Training Instructor Igrid, and the commander responsible for training soldiers. "
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5580 (mes)
- "[Expedition Messenger]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5581 (mes)
- "Welcome, I've been waiting for you."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5582 (mes)
- "You must be "
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5583 (mes)
- ". Nice to meet you."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5584 (mes)
- "[Expedition Messenger]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5585 (mes)
- "Let me check something quicly. You received the report directly from the commander, didn't you? May I see it?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5586 (mes)
- "..."
+ "..."
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#5587 (mes)
