+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6148 (mes)
- "When the target of the trace dies, the pair of stones are automatically destroyed."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6149 (mes)
- "Since this patterned magic stone is still intact.."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6150 (mes)
- "[Manager]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6151 (mes)
- "Well, this magic stone serves as proof that the target of the trace is still alive somewhere in the world."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6152 (mes)
- "I'll keep watching."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6153 (mes)
- "Hopefully, we'll detect the same wavelength."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6154 (mes)
- "[Manager]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6155 (mes)
- "That's all for today."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6156 (mes)
- "Everything's okay so far!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6157 (mes)
- "How may I help you?"
+ "Em que posso ajudar?"
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6158 (mes)
- "[Manager]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6159 (mes)
- "Please report this to Captain Echinacea;"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6160 (mes)
- "We've failed to trace the location of the target,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6161 (mes)
- "but he's still alive somewhere."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6162 (mes)
- "This device detects mana and magic wavelengths around this area. identifying what enemies we're dealing with."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6163 (mes)
- "It can be used to trace the wavelengths of location-tracing spells."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6164 (mes)
- "[Manager]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6165 (mes)
- "It's a fantastic product made from a combination of magic and science."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6166 (mes)
- "The Ash Vacuum hasn't been fully explored, and we don't know what kind of dangers to expect in this area."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6167 (mes)
- "[Manager]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6168 (mes)
- "By using this device, we can check the change and flow of mana around this area,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6169 (mes)
- "and prepare for any possible threats."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6170 (mes)
- "- You cannot proceed with the quest when you're carrying too many items with you. -"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6171 (cutin)
- "mocseal_kid01"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6172 (mes)
- "[Mr. Kidd]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6173 (mes)
- "Hey, you."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6174 (mes)
- "Don't get too close to anything except the gate."
