- "[Mr. Kidd]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6180 (mes)
- "An assistant? I don't think I need one, but..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6181 (mes)
- "I guess I should give you something to do."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6182 (mes)
- "Do you mind if I entrust you with a chore?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6183 (select)
- "Yes.:No, I don't mind at all."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6184 (mes)
- "[Mr. Kidd]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6185 (mes)
- "Then why did you come all this way?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6186 (mes)
- "I didn't really need any help to begin with. If you don't want to work, then stop bothering me."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6187 (mes)
- "[Mr. Kidd]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6188 (mes)
- "If you don't want to help us out then go back to Echinacea and let her know yourself!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6189 (mes)
- "[Mr. Kidd]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6190 (mes)
- "......"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6191 (mes)
- "I don't know if Echinacea told you this already, but we are here"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6192 (mes)
- "to follow the traces of Satan Morocc."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6193 (mes)
- "Some of us are here in the Ash Vacuum, and the rest are on the Midgard Continent."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6194 (mes)
- "[Mr. Kidd]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6195 (mes)
- "We exchange information with our colleagues in Morocc on a regular basis, but we haven't heard from them for a while."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6196 (mes)
- "How'd you like to go gather some information for me?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6197 (mes)
- "It should be simple, so you I hope you'll be able to handle this."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6198 (mes)
- "[Mr. Kidd]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6199 (mes)
- "At Southwest Morocc, you'll find an underground tavern."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6200 (mes)
- "Go find ^4d4dffRin^000000."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6201 (mes)
- "Tell her I've sent you, and she'll take care of you."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6202 (mes)
- "[Mr. Kidd]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6203 (mes)
- "If you don't have any business here, then step aside. It's too dangerous."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6204 (mes)
