#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6273 (mes)
- "..Wh.. Who said I'm worried?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6274 (mes)
- "I asked about her because I don't want her injury to interfere with our schedule."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6275 (mes)
- "[Mr. Kidd]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6276 (mes)
- "As for you, I want you to come back later."
