#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6277 (mes)
- "You're my assistant, remember?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6278 (mes)
- "I need you to substitute for Rin until she recovers.."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6279 (mes)
- "Is that understood?"
