#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6280 (cutin)
- "moc2_kid05"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6281 (mes)
- "[Mr. Kidd]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6282 (mes)
- "Hm, thanks for all your help."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6283 (mes)
- "Now, would you leave me alone for a while? I need to write a report based on the findings in this journal."
