#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6297 (mes)
- "No, nothing."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6298 (mes)
- "I'm sorry if I bothered you while you were writing your report."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6299 (mes)
