#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6314 (mes)
- "["
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6315 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6316 (mes)
- "What do you mean.."
