#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6340 (cutin)
- "mocseal_kid01"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6341 (mes)
- "[Mr. Kidd]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6342 (mes)
- "By the way, I saw you touch this 'Bloody Crystal of Darkness.'"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6343 (mes)
- "There was a bright flash of light around you, and then you were suddenly drawn into the space gap."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6344 (mes)
- "[Mr. Kidd]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6345 (mes)
- "I thought I was just seeing things, but it's obvious now that it really happened."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6346 (mes)
- "You were actually in the past for a little while there."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6347 (mes)
- "[Mr. Kidd]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6348 (mes)
- "I'm afraid this space gap hides bigger secrets than we thought."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6349 (mes)
