#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6612 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6613 (mes)
- "..............."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6614 (mes)
- "Are you also here..............."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6615 (mes)
- "to make fun of my stupid attempt to roast these sweet potatoes with wet firewood?"
