#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6616 (select)
- "...No."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6617 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6618 (mes)
- "...No? Then what brings you here?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6619 (mes)
- "...Huh?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6620 (mes)
- "A spell scroll? May I see?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6621 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6622 (mes)
- "...Isn't... Isn't this?!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6623 (mes)
- "...Hmm..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6624 (mes)
- "Eek... So Echinacea referred you to me, huh?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6625 (mes)
- "...Does that means she knows everything...?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6626 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6627 (mes)
- "...Alright then, I'll tell you."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6628 (mes)
- "As you can see, this scroll is sealed."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6629 (mes)
- "It can only be unsealed by a secret method."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6630 (mes)
- "...And..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6631 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6632 (mes)
- "...It is from...."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6633 (mes)
- "...Arunafeltz?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6634 (mes)
- "The way it's sealed is the same method used by the temple..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6635 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6636 (mes)
- "I don't know how you've gotten this scroll,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6637 (mes)
- "...but I'll try to help you on behalf of the respectable scholars of Arunafeltz."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6638 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6639 (mes)
- "But remember; I'm not doing this officially. Please don't make me disgrace my country by helping you. Do you understand what I'm saying?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6640 (select)
- "Got it.:No."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6641 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6642 (mes)
- "Good. Then I expect you to help me by gathering the items I need to unseal the scroll:"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6643 (mes)
- "^4d4dff30 Holy Waters, Runes of Darkness, and Bloody Runes^000000."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6644 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6645 (mes)
- "I'll be waiting for your return."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6646 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6647 (mes)
- "At first, you looked like someone who is reliable and understands the difference between official and private matters."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6648 (mes)
- "Your answer just proved me wrong."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6649 (mes)
- "Echinacea must be getting desperate if she's asking people like you for help."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6650 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6651 (mes)
- "Oh, you've brought everything!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6652 (mes)
- "Good, it wasn't hard, was it?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6653 (mes)
- "Okay, can you come back in a little bit?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6654 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6655 (mes)
- "To unseal the scroll,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6656 (mes)
- "I need ^4d4dff30 Holy Waters, Runes of the Darkness, and Bloody Runes^000000."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6657 (mes)
- "Don't forget to bring the spell scroll along with them."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6658 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6659 (mes)
- "While you're gathering the items, I'll be roasting my sweet potatoes."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6660 (mes)
- "If I could only make this fire work..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6661 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6662 (mes)
- "Welcome back; you came at the perfect time."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6663 (mes)
- "First, this spell scroll contains a teleportation spell."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6664 (mes)
- "You know what teleportation is, don't you?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6665 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6666 (mes)
- "You know,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6667 (mes)
- "it's a spell that instantly moves you to a different location."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6668 (mes)
- "That's the spell contained in this scroll."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6669 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6670 (mes)
- "The only difference is..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6671 (mes)
- "This scroll will teleport you to a specific location."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6672 (mes)
- "Such scrolls are generally used by ^4d4dfforganizations to gather their members^000000."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6673 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6674 (mes)
- "I don't know where this scroll will lead you.."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6675 (mes)
- "You'll be the one using this scroll. Am I right?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6676 (mes)
- "Here, please take this."
