#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6690 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6691 (mes)
- "What are you so worried about?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6692 (mes)
- "You'll see how it works as soon as you use it."
