#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6695 (mes)
- "...."
+ "...."
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6696 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6697 (mes)
- "..Huh? What do you want?"
