#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6715 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6716 (mes)
- "I may be old,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6717 (mes)
- "but I'm a representative of great Arunafeltz's scholars!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6718 (mes)
- "It's a mistake to trifle with me like that!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6719 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6720 (mes)
- "Did you think I'm stupid just because I was trying to make a fire with wet firewood?!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6721 (mes)
- "..*Pant Pant*.. Phew, even yelling tires me out.."
