#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6727 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6728 (mes)
- "...Let's see..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6729 (mes)
- "I need sweet potatoes for me, Mr. Kidd, and Echi... Umm..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6730 (mes)
