- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6732 (mes)
- "Please bring me ^4d4dff20 Sweet Potatoes and 30 Logs^000000."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6733 (mes)
- "I'll be waiting for your return."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6734 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6735 (mes)
- "You seem to give up really easily."
