#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6773 (mes)
- "Didn't you forget something?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6774 (mes)
- "... Dandelion? I wanted you to tell me what you knew."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6775 (mes)
- "I was hoping you'd remember something about Dandelion."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6776 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6777 (mes)
- "So,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6778 (mes)
- "do you want me to confirm"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6779 (mes)
- "if Dandelion is really supported by Arunafeltz?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6780 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6781 (mes)
- "Umm... I don't know what to say... I don't feel comfortable talking about politics."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6782 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6783 (mes)
- "...Do you mind delivering these to Mr. Kidd?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6784 (mes)
- "- Defaria has given you 2 Nice Sweet Potatoes. -"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6785 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6786 (mes)
- "Um, I just told you to deliver those sweet potatoes to Mr. Kidd."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6787 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6788 (mes)
- "Say, did he like them?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6789 (mes)
- "Hahaha..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6790 (mes)
- "... ... "
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6791 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6792 (mes)
- "Dandelion was like a ghost."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6793 (mes)
- "There are many different types of people in this world."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6794 (mes)
- "Some people want war while others are against it."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6795 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6796 (mes)
- "The Dandelions were the former case."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6797 (mes)
- "Those right-ists believed in a distorted patriotism. They thought shedding blood was the only way to make peace."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6798 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6799 (mes)
- "They organized Dandelion,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6800 (mes)
- "and they happened to ally themselves with the warmongers in the government."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6801 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6802 (mes)
- "That's how they grew so strong."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6803 (mes)
- "At first, their purpose was limited to gathering intel and spying on other countries."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6804 (mes)
- "This is just what I think, but the right information can cause chaos in a country."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6805 (select)
- "Then what..?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6806 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6807 (mes)
- "Can't you see it by now? Isn't it obvious?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6808 (mes)
- "Well, if you can't take care of your own problems,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6809 (mes)
- "then you won't be able to handle your enemies."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6810 (select)
- "So Arunafeltz planned all this!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6811 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6812 (mes)
- "No, it isn't that simple. The world isn't just black and white, you know?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6813 (mes)
- "Just bring these to Echinacea, will you?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6814 (mes)
- "They're cooked very well."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6815 (mes)
- "- You have received 2 steaming hot Nice Sweet Potatoes. -"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6816 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6817 (mes)
- "I told you to deliver those cooked sweet potatoes to Echinacea."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6818 (mes)
- "Don't eat them, alright?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6819 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6820 (mes)
- "Muhahahaha!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6821 (mes)
- "Did Echinacea really say that?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6822 (mes)
- "She's an executive of the Rune-Midgarts army."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6823 (mes)
- "I can tell that what she said came from the bottom of her heart."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6824 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6825 (mes)
- "I'm relieved that things turned out this way."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6826 (mes)
- "After all, they're the reason why the three countries decided to cooperate."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6827 (mes)
- "Of course, it's too early to say if the cooperation will last long."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6828 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6829 (mes)
- "I just hope that the three countries will use this chance to form lasting, friendly relationships. Wouldn't that be great for the sake of everyone in the world?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6830 (mes)
- "Hrrm, but I'm not holding my breath for world peace."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6831 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6832 (mes)
- "I'm just a mere human who can't foresee the future, you know?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6833 (mes)
- "..Hahaha.."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6834 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6835 (mes)
- "Ah, your sweet potatoes are now roasted very well."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6836 (mes)
- "Here, enjoy them."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6837 (mes)
- "Thank you for trying so hard to please this whimsical old man."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6838 (mes)
- "- Defaria is lost in thought, standing with a poker in one hand"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6839 (mes)
- "and a sweet potato in the other. -"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6840 (mes)
- "- Sometimes, he looks to the sky, sighs, and then says, 'I'm envious of young people these days ..'"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6841 (mes)
- "or something like 'I don't care anymore, no matter what happens.' -"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6842 (mes)
- "- It sounds like he's having some pretty deep moments, so let's not disturb him. -"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6843 (mes)
- "[Defaria]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6844 (mes)
- "Please leave me alone unless you have extremely important business with me."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6845 (mes)
- "I have so many things that I want to do..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6846 (mes)
- "You've found some half-burnt logs of high quality."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6847 (mes)
- "It seems somebody already roasted sweet potatoes with these logs."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6848 (mes)
- "You've found camp firewood that is too wet to make a fire."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6849 (mes)
- "It seems somebody has been futilely attempting to make a fire with them."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6850 (mes)
- "[Jack]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6851 (mes)
- "Almost half of this town has been destroyed,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6852 (mes)
- "and yet some people still come to visit."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6853 (mes)
- "I must say that it's amazing that our stronghold is still intact, and withstood all the devastation."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6854 (mes)
- "As you see, half of this town is gone. I guess there's no real reason to control access to this tavern."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6855 (mes)
- "Just feel free to go in."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6856 (mes)
- "[Jack]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6857 (mes)
