#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6928 (mes)
- "[Karred]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6929 (mes)
- "...Rin? I see. So you're assisting Mr. Kidd."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6930 (mes)
- "Rin...she's in the room inside."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6931 (mes)
- "She was gravely injured not that long ago..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6932 (select)
- "?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6933 (mes)
- "[Karred]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6934 (mes)
- "You can't expect your job to always go smoothly."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6935 (mes)
- "Of course there will be risks."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6936 (mes)
- "Why don't you go pay her a visit?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6937 (mes)
- "[Karred]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6938 (mes)
- "Rin needs to rest for now. I hope you'll do what you can to help her out."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6939 (mes)
- "But please do take care of yourself as well."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6940 (mes)
- "[Karred]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6941 (mes)
- "You and Rin are like my children to me, and such injuries..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6942 (mes)
- "Sigh...it's torture for me to see."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6943 (mes)
- "[Karred]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6944 (mes)
- "I hope you'll come by more often. This place is open to you always, even if you don't have missions."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6945 (mes)
- "[Karred]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6946 (mes)
- "Rin needs to rest in bed for a while. I hope you'll help her complete her duties."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6947 (mes)
- "...This is quite embarrassing to admit, but I see her like my own daughter."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6948 (mes)
- "[Litheron]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6949 (mes)
- "Ah, just forget what I said. That was out of line."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6950 (mes)
- "I guess I'm drunk after dealing with alcohol all day."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6951 (mes)
- "[Karred]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6952 (mes)
- "How may I help you?"
