- "[Karred]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6960 (mes)
- "I see. So you're a member of the Ash Vacuum expedition."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6961 (mes)
- "Rin is in the inner room."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#6962 (mes)
