#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7287 (cutin)
- "moc2_rin01"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7288 (mes)
- "[Rin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7289 (mes)
- "Thank you for your kindness."
