#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7290 (mes)
- "...*Pant Pant*..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7291 (mes)
- "[Rin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7292 (mes)
- "I received these injuries from Rayan and his gang. I finally located them after a long stakeout and pursuit..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7293 (mes)
- "......... ..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7294 (mes)
- "[Rin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7295 (mes)
- "Yes... I need to write this down..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7296 (mes)
- "- Mumbling something, she took down notes in an old notebook as she spoke. -"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7297 (mes)
- "[Rin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7298 (mes)
- "The Dandelions.. They're Rayan's puppets."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7299 (mes)
- "I was ambushed by them in a mountain far from a village..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7300 (mes)
- "[Rin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7301 (mes)
- "When I woke up, I was here."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7302 (mes)
- "Since then, my vision's been blurry. I guess that must have been caused by my injuries..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7303 (mes)
- "[Rin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7304 (mes)
- "How'd you like to conduct an investigation around that area? We might find something.."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7305 (mes)
- "Like important clues or where they've headed..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7306 (mes)
- "[Rin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7307 (mes)
- "^4d4dffIf you're interested in helping me, I'll continue talking.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7308 (cutin)
- "moc2_rin03"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7309 (mes)
- "[Rin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7310 (mes)
- "Did you just come by for no reason?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7311 (mes)
- "...God, I can't believe just let you come here!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7312 (mes)
- "Grr.. I need to teach them a lesson. Why can't they let me rest for God's sake!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7313 (mes)
- "[Rin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7314 (mes)
- "I'm sorry, but I'm extremely tired and cranky."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7315 (mes)
- "If you don't have anything important to tell me, then I'd like you to leave."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7316 (cutin)
- "moc2_rin01"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7317 (mes)
- "[Rin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7318 (mes)
- "So, are you interested in helping me?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7319 (mes)
- "I remember the location was... Southwest from a village called Hugel."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7320 (mes)
- "Do you know where to find Abyss Lake, where the Dragons reside?."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7321 (mes)
- "[Rin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7322 (mes)
- "^4d4dffWhen you pass Abyss Lake and head west,^000000 you'll arrive at stiff mountains."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7323 (mes)
- "I was ambushed somewhere ^4d4dffsouth of the second hill from the top of the mountain^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7324 (mes)
- "[Rin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7325 (mes)
- "They ganged up on me, but I put up a good fight..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7326 (mes)
- "I'm sure I at least made them drop something.."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7327 (mes)
- "Please try to find something there that might serve as a clue."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7328 (mes)
- "[Rin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7329 (mes)
- "While you're gone, I'll be preparing a document to send to Mr. Kidd."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7330 (mes)
- "Be safe, and look out for yourself, okay?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7331 (cutin)
- "moc2_rin01"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7332 (mes)
- "[Rin]"
