#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7334 (mes)
- "somewhere south of the second hill of a mountain west from Abyss Lake."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7335 (mes)
- "[Rin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7336 (mes)
- "What are you looking at?"
