#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7403 (cutin)
- "moc2_dan02"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7404 (mes)
- "[Rayan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7405 (mes)
- "I know what I did is unforgivable, no matter how good my reason might be."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7406 (mes)
- "..But... *Sigh*... It's too late to regret it now, isn't it?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7407 (select)
- "Who is this?"
