#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7408 (cutin)
- "moc2_rin01"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7409 (mes)
- "[Rin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7410 (mes)
- "Don't you know? He's Rayan Moore who dared to release Satan Morocc, deceive everyone, and bring havoc to this world."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7411 (mes)
- "And you know what?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7412 (mes)
- "[Rin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7413 (mes)
- "Not only that, he slaughtered his own comrades without mercy!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7414 (cutin)
- "moc2_dan02"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7415 (mes)
- "[Rayan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7416 (mes)
- "...Waaah!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7417 (mes)
- "..I.. I.. I killed them with my own hands!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7418 (mes)
- "*Sob*.."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7419 (mes)
- "I'm.. I'm sorry.."
