#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7420 (mes)
- "- Rayan is shivering in fear."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7421 (mes)
- "He still hasn't gotten over the fact that he killed all of his comrades.-"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7422 (mes)
- "["
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7423 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7424 (mes)
- "What is going on?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7425 (mes)
- "He doesn't look like the Rayan I know."
