#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7426 (cutin)
- "moc2_rin03"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7427 (mes)
- "[Rin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7428 (mes)
- "I don't know. This Rayan seems to be a completely different individual than the one we know."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7429 (mes)
- "I guess this is what they call Multiple Personality Disorder."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7430 (mes)
- "[Rin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7431 (mes)
- "This Rayan isn't the Rayan Moore that plotted the conspiracy,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7432 (mes)
- "but another personality hidden inside of him."
