#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7433 (cutin)
- "moc2_rin01"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7434 (mes)
- "[Rin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7435 (mes)
- "Hey, calm down. Why don't you speak slowly?"
