#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7436 (cutin)
- "moc2_dan02"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7437 (mes)
- "[Rayan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7438 (mes)
- "..It was me.. I was only going to pretend to break the seal of Satan Morocc..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7439 (mes)
- "Don't you see? I meant for it to just be an act! I was going to throw the town in panic..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7440 (mes)
- "[Rayan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_13_1.txt#7441 (mes)
- "..That would be my chance to spread the teachings of Freya, our messiah."
