- "Everyone gave up after the first try. You did it three times."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#180 (npctalk)
- "Elder Jaegyom, nightmares weren't the only thing occurred to me this time."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#182 (npctalk)
- "It was different from the other two times I performed the ritual."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#184 (npctalk)
- "How different?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#185 (npctalk)
- "..."
+ "..."
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#187 (npctalk)
- "It felt as if the nightmares is happening in reality."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#189 (npctalk)
- "What do you mean? You were only trying to give peace to the angered spirits of the nine tailed foxes."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#190 (npctalk)
- "What did you see in the cave?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#191 (npctalk)
- "I can't explain what I saw. You have to see it to believe it."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#193 (npctalk)
- "We need someone strong to go in there, like that adventurer over there, should go in the cave."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#195 (mes)
- "[ Muyeon ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#196 (mes)
- "Okay, I'll tell you the story."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#197 (mes)
- "The Payon Cave is used to be a part of a village that was buried under a landslide."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#198 (mes)
- "[ Muyeon ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#199 (mes)
- "As you can guess many people were buried with it, and their spirits are hunting the cave."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#200 (mes)
- "[ Muyeon ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#201 (mes)
- "Some of them were the nine-tailed foxes. The foxes anger is beyond normal."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#202 (mes)
- "That's the reason we have been performing a ritual in regular basis."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#203 (mes)
- "[ Muyeon ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#204 (mes)
- "But now the problem is,"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#205 (mes)
- "The foxes spirits are getting more resentful by time, and no one knows the reason why."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#206 (mes)
- "Maybe the ritual is the reason they are angry, it's not working as we hoped it would."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#207 (mes)
- "[ Muyeon ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#208 (mes)
- "And, every time I performed the ritual, I had nightmares about the resentful spirits and wailing nine-tailed foxes."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#209 (mes)
- "[ Muyeon ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#210 (mes)
- "Soul Linkers communicates with the spirits for a living, Having nightmares is just occurs normally."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#211 (mes)
- "[ Muyeon ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#212 (mes)
- "So when my first nightmare occurred, I thought it was under the same boat as the others."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#213 (mes)
- "But now I know the difference, It also has nothing to do with my health."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#214 (mes)
- "[ Muyeon ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#215 (mes)
- "Whatever it is the reason that agitates the spirits of the nine-tailed foxes."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#216 (mes)
- "It drove me from sanity and sent me going to the ruined village."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#217 (mes)
- "[ Muyeon ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#218 (mes)
- "And, I saw something."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#219 (mes)
- "It's an image of another world, different from ours."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#220 (mes)
- "We must shut that place down, so no one will be able to access it."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#221 (mes)
- "[ Muyeon ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#222 (mes)
- "I have an uneasy feeling that a dreadful is going to take place."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#223 (mes)
- "Or maybe it's already taking place.."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#224 (mes)
- "[ Muyeon ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#225 (mes)
- "The vague image I saw is indistinguishable from hell."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#226 (mes)
- "I saw it after the last ritual that I did."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#227 (mes)
- "[ Muyeon ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#228 (mes)
- "I beg of you, don't ask me to return doing that again."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#229 (mes)
- "I'm not mentally strong enough to handle such nightmares."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#230 (mes)
- "[ Muyeon ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#231 (mes)
- "Much less on what's taking place inside the cave."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#232 (mes)
- "[ Muyeon ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#233 (mes)
- "If you want to go, you'll have to go alone and see it for yourself."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#234 (mes)
- "I still carry the fox bead that I tried to purify. Let me know when you are ready."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#235 (mes)
- "[ Muyeon ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#236 (mes)
- "Are you ready?"
