- "[ Muyeon ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#241 (mes)
- "Okay, this fox bead is not completely purged yet."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#242 (mes)
- "Place it in your hand."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#243 (mes)
- "[ Muyeon ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#244 (mes)
- "Relax... and focus your mind on it ... open your mind to its energy."
