- "[ Muyeon ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#281 (mes)
- "Now you know what I've been through."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#282 (mes)
