#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#283 (mes)
- "[ Muyeon ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#284 (mes)
- "If you decide to do it, it'll make you one of us, very ecstatic. Probably because he is a fool."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#285 (mes)
- "[ Muyeon ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#286 (mes)
- "If you're looking for the teacher, she's in the other room."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#287 (mes)
- "[ Muyeon ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#288 (mes)
- "I see."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#289 (mes)
- "So They've come true."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#290 (mes)
- "You don't know why, do you?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#291 (mes)
- "[ Muyeon ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#292 (mes)
- "Maybe it's because the walls between reality and dreams have collapsed."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#293 (mes)
- "Otherwise, how could you go in and out of someone else's dream?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#294 (mes)
- "[ Muyeon ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#295 (mes)
- "I know they're ^0000FFdreamt by the Moonlight Flowers.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#296 (mes)
- "I don't know how they've become reality. I doubt anyone knows, really."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#297 (mes)
- "[ Muyeon ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#298 (mes)
- "As far as I remember, nothing like this has ever happened before. If we want to figure this out, we're on our own."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#299 (mes)
- "[ Muyeon ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#300 (mes)
- "Well, I'll let Chunghae figure it out."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#301 (mes)
- "Alright, then I'd better go get some rest."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#302 (mes)
- "[ Muyeon ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#303 (mes)
- "Now that I know that those nightmares really originated from Moonlight Flowers, I feel better."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#304 (mes)
- "I can sleep at last."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#305 (mes)
- "[ Muyeon ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#306 (mes)
- "We won't need more rituals once we deal with the nightmares."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#307 (mes)
- "Does this mean I'm free? Free at last!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#308 (mes)
- "I don't even know how to thank you."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#309 (mes)
- "[ Muyeon ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#310 (mes)
- "I've found this strange stones while I was there. It's not much,"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#311 (mes)
- "but maybe you can find an use for those?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#312 (mes)
- "Thank you so much adventurer."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#313 (mes)
- "[ Muyeon ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#314 (mes)
- "Good luck investigating the phenomenon with Chunghae!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#315 (mes)
- "Once the nightmares are gone, we won't need to perform the ritual anymore!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#316 (mes)
- "[ Muyeon ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#317 (mes)
- "How can I be sure, you ask?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#318 (mes)
- "I'm not sure. Heh heh."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#319 (mes)
- "They might not go away completely."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#320 (mes)
- "Who knows?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#325 (npctalk)
- "Muyeon... If you can't do it, no one else can!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#327 (npctalk)
- "Let's listen for now."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#329 (mes)
- "[ Jagyeom ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#330 (mes)
- "We should grasp the situation first."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#331 (mes)
- "It'll be great if you can help us, Adventurer."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#332 (mes)
- "[ Jagyeom ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#333 (mes)
- "The Moonlight Flower are recreating the past in their nightmares."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#334 (mes)
- "In a way, they're also victims."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#335 (mes)
- "[ Jagyeom ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#336 (mes)
