- "[ Young Scholar ]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#340 (mes)
- "Payon is home for sacred creatures since ancient times."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#341 (mes)
- "A town isolated from the world by the mountains, the people of Payon way of thinking is different from the outside."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#342 (npctalk)
- "Muyeon is really upset. We should ask her what happened."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#344 (npctalk)
