#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#860 (mes)
- "[Grimm]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#861 (mes)
- "Back then, only a couple of monsters showed up once every decade or so."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#862 (select)
- "What changed that?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#863 (mes)
- "[Grimm]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#864 (mes)
