#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#905 (mes)
- "[Mojo]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#906 (mes)
- "But wait, Adventurer. You haven't heard my side of the story."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#907 (npctalk)
- "You've got to listen to both sides before you judge!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#908 (npctalk)
- "Mojo#ilgf"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#909 (mes)
- "[Mojo]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#910 (mes)
- "We understand the things that we want to study can be dangerous, so we try our best to be careful."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#911 (npctalk)
