#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#971 (mes)
- "I placed my hand on the book Father Grimm was holding. Suddenly I felt dizzy as the air around me shimmered. Carefully, I opened the notebook."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#972 (mes)
- "[Daily Journal]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#973 (mes)
- "I fainted in the middle of learning a new spell, again."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#974 (mes)
- "My low stamina and insufficient mana are always the problem. I thought I could make up for my weak constitution with magic. Of course, even that required some minimal stamina, but I didn't have even that."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#975 (mes)
- "I'm too tired..."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#976 (mes)
- "[Daily Journal]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#977 (mes)
- "I saw Sophia drinking a mana potion. Maybe potions are the answer to my never-ending search for physical support. "
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#978 (mes)
- "I wonder if there are special potions that could improve me physically. Then, I could become stronger at last."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#979 (mes)
- "[Daily Journal]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#980 (mes)
- "All the potions I found didn't help improve my weak constitution. All they do is boost strength that's already there."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#981 (mes)
- "Maybe I should try to formulate stamina and mana potions on my own."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#982 (mes)
- "[Daily Journal]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#983 (mes)
- "I learned about the catacombs under the Geffen Tower while I was in the library, reading about the tower's history."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#984 (mes)
- "How are the dead reanimated? What kind of vital force keeps them moving?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#985 (mes)
- "I need permission to enter the catacombs. I'm going to check them tomorrow."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#986 (mes)
- "[Daily Journal]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#987 (mes)
