- "[Bomi]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1828 (mes)
- "Most people try to make the most out of life because they know they can't live forever."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1829 (mes)
- "[Bomi]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1830 (mes)
- "I was given a shorter time to live than most. Ever since I was born, I'd been told I'd never outlive my parents."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1831 (mes)
- "[Bomi]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1832 (mes)
- "People desire what they don't have. I desired ^0000cdstrength^000000 because I was too small and frail to live like others my age."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1833 (mes)
- "[Bomi]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1834 (mes)
- "I became a wizard because I thought magic could compensate for my physical weakness."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1835 (mes)
- "[Bomi]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1836 (mes)
- "I didn't realize a strong mind comes from a strong body, though..."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1837 (mes)
- "[Bomi]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1838 (mes)
- "Magic was exhausting to both my mind and my body. I reached my limits more quickly than I thought. But I wasn't upset. I thought I could remedy that."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1840 (unittalk)
