+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1841 (mes)
- "[Bomi]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1842 (mes)
- "Yes. Doing that, I felt more alive than ever. My burning desire for life made me who I was."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1843 (mes)
- "[Bomi]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1844 (mes)
- "Then, one day, while I was here, I met an ^0000cdentity^000000 who was not human."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1845 (mes)
