+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1851 (npctalk)
- "There's one more."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1854 (unittalk)
- " : Are you talking about Dracula? I've heard of him."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1855 (npctalk)
- "When I first met him, he was close to perishing. His vulnerability reminded me strongly of my own. "
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1857 (npctalk)
- "That's why I fed him my blood and tended to his wounds, even though I knew I shouldn't."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1859 (npctalk)
- "Later, I met him again and we got close. He was my first real friend."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1864 (npctalk)
- "Why did you save me?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1865 (npctalk)
- "Dracula#ilgf01"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1866 (npctalk)
- "It's hard to explain. Let's just say we humans like to save others."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1868 (npctalk)
- "That's not true. Others of your kind just want to kill me."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1869 (npctalk)
- "Dracula#ilgf01"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1870 (npctalk)
- "Not all of us are made the same."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1872 (npctalk)
- "How about I give you a gift in return for your favor? I know you want a strong body and longevity."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1873 (npctalk)
- "Dracula#ilgf01"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1874 (npctalk)
- "But how? Wait, are you offering...? No, thanks."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1876 (npctalk)
- "You want them so badly that you're risking your life by studying in a place like this."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1877 (npctalk)
- "Dracula#ilgf01"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1878 (npctalk)
- "I do, but I don't want to give up my humanity for them."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1880 (npctalk)
- "But you're afraid of dying. And your days are numbered."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1881 (npctalk)
- "Dracula#ilgf01"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1882 (npctalk)
- "My fear of death is what keeps me going. It's made me who I am."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1884 (npctalk)
- "Giving up my humanity for eternal life goes against my beliefs, all my hard work up till now, and everything I tried hard to protect."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1886 (npctalk)
- "Above all, I'll be giving up on myself, and I can't do that."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1888 (npctalk)
- "Even if you're turned, you'll still be you."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1889 (npctalk)
- "Dracula#ilgf01"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1890 (npctalk)
- "On the outside, maybe. But I will no longer fear death, and therefore have no desire to live."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1892 (npctalk)
- "It pains me to see you wither away, day by day."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1893 (npctalk)
- "Dracula#ilgf01"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1894 (npctalk)
- "I can't say I understand your logic, but I'll respect your wishes."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#1895 (npctalk)
- "Dracula#ilgf01"
+ ""
