#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#2983 (mes)
- "[Dracula]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#2984 (mes)
- "There was an accident. The people who almost killed me found me again."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#2985 (npctalk)
- "The people from the Church?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#2986 (npctalk)
