+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#2987 (mes)
- "[Dracula]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#2988 (mes)
- "Bad luck follows me wherever I go. Bomi even made me a lucky charm, but it didn't work."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#2989 (mes)
- "[Dracula]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#2990 (mes)
- "By then, I'd fully regained my strength, and those humans weren't a match for me. But Bomi... she didn't want anyone to get hurt."
