+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#3309 (mes)
- "Like I told you earlier, when this cave was a kingdom, the king had a pet lizard. One day, this lizard wandered outside of the kingdom to see the outside world, but ended up getting lost. The king was so angry at the lizard that he cursed him."
