- "[Jerrymon]"
+ "[Jeremias]"
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5311 (mes)
- "Adventurer, do you know where the deepest part of the sea is?"
+ "Aventureiro, você sabe onde fica o ponto mais fundo do mar?"
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5312 (select)
- "Well...??"
+ "Bem...??"
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5313 (mes)
- "[Jerrymon]"
+ "[Jeremias]"
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5314 (mes)
- "It is a place called the ^4d4dffTrench^000000. To put it simply, you can think of it as a deep cliff in the sea."
+ "É um lugar chamado ^4d4dffFossa^000000. Resumindo, pense nele como um penhasco fundo dentro do mar."
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5315 (mes)
- "[Jerrymon]"
+ "[Jeremias]"
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5316 (mes)
- "It is known that there are hundreds of different types of trenches in the world's oceans."
+ "Sabe-se que existem centenas de tipos de fossas nos oceanos do mundo."
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5317 (mes)
- "[Jerrymon]"
+ "[Jeremias]"
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5318 (mes)
- "The widest and deepest known trench is the ^4d4dffBahia Trench^000000 near Izlude."
+ "A fossa mais larga e mais funda que se conhece é a ^4d4dffFossa de Bahia^000000, perto de Izlude."
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5319 (mes)
- "[Jerrymon]"
+ "[Jeremias]"
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5320 (mes)
- "There are rare life forms at the bottom of the trench, and marine scientists like myself have shown great interest and have been exploring them."
+ "No fundo da fossa existem formas de vida raras, e cientistas marinhos como eu têm muito interesse nelas e vêm explorando o lugar."
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5321 (mes)
- "[Jerrymon]"
+ "[Jeremias]"
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5322 (mes)
- "Though shallow trenches can be explored to some extent."
+ "As fossas rasas até dá para explorar um pouco."
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5323 (mes)
- "[Jerrymon]"
+ "[Jeremias]"
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5324 (mes)
- "But in the case of the Bahia Trench, scientists have calculated that scientifically, no life can exist because it is so incredibly deep."
+ "Mas, no caso da Fossa de Bahia, os cientistas calcularam que nenhuma vida pode existir lá, de tão incrivelmente funda que ela é."
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5325 (mes)
- "[Jerrymon]"
+ "[Jeremias]"
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5326 (mes)
- "I recently found out that there is life in the Bahia Trench."
+ "Há pouco tempo descobri que existe vida na Fossa de Bahia."
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5327 (select)
- "How do you know that??"
+ "Como você sabe disso??"
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5328 (mes)
- "[Jerrymon]"
+ "[Jeremias]"
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5329 (mes)
- "You can tell by the stone that contains my magic."
+ "Dá para saber pela pedra que guarda a minha magia."
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5330 (select)
- "A stone with magical power?"
+ "Uma pedra com poder mágico?"
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5331 (mes)
- "[Jerrymon]"
+ "[Jeremias]"
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5332 (mes)
- "Yes, I'm a mage-turned-oceanographer. I learned magic for oceanography."
+ "Isso, eu sou um mago que virou oceanógrafo. Aprendi magia para estudar o oceano."
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5333 (mes)
- "[Jerrymon]"
+ "[Jeremias]"
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5334 (mes)
- "Enchant a large boulder and make it fall to the floor where the trench exists."
+ "Eu encanto uma pedra grande e a deixo cair até o fundo onde fica a fossa."
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5335 (mes)
- "[Jerrymon]"
+ "[Jeremias]"
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5336 (mes)
- "The magic on the dropped stone is connected to me, so by measuring the distance, I can get a little idea of how deep it is and what's going on near the stone."
+ "A magia da pedra que caiu fica ligada a mim, então, medindo a distância, eu consigo ter uma ideia de quão fundo é e do que acontece perto da pedra."
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5337 (mes)
- "[Jerrymon]"
+ "[Jeremias]"
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5338 (mes)
- "To tell you what I found out..."
+ "Para te contar o que eu descobri..."
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5339 (mes)
- "[Jerrymon]"
+ "[Jeremias]"
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5340 (mes)
- "The composition of normal sea water and deep sea water is almost the same. But the only difference is the deep sea of Bahia Trench."
+ "A composição da água do mar comum e da água do mar profundo é quase a mesma. A única diferença é o mar profundo da Fossa de Bahia."
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5341 (mes)
- "[Jerrymon]"
+ "[Jeremias]"
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5342 (mes)
- "Should I say it's like water and oil? There's a section where they never mix."
+ "Como água e óleo, digamos? Tem uma parte em que elas nunca se misturam."
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5343 (mes)
- "[Jerrymon]"
+ "[Jeremias]"
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5344 (mes)
- "A strong boundary was formed where they meet each other, and it felt as if the deep seawater in that section was desperately blocking the seawater coming down from above."
+ "Onde elas se encontram formou-se uma fronteira forte, e parecia que a água profunda daquele trecho bloqueava desesperadamente a água que descia de cima."
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5345 (mes)
- "[Jerrymon]"
+ "[Jeremias]"
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5346 (mes)
- "The water pressure is also much lower than that of normal seawater, so it is assumed that it has a favorable environment for life."
+ "A pressão da água também é bem mais baixa que a da água do mar comum, então imagino que seja um ambiente favorável à vida."
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5347 (mes)
- "[Jerrymon]"
+ "[Jeremias]"
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5348 (mes)
