+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5881 (mes)
- "[Sirood]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5882 (mes)
- "About 3 months ago... I went fishing on a rainy and windy day."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5883 (mes)
- "[Sirood]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5884 (mes)
- "After I caught my first fish, I tripped and fell into the water while trying to get it out with a fishing pole."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5885 (mes)
- "[Sirood]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5886 (mes)
- "I was trying to swim as hard as I could to get out, but I felt something pulling me in with great force."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5887 (mes)
- "[Sirood]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5888 (mes)
- "What, it looked like a whirlpool... I thought I was going to die... and when I woke up, I found this place."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5889 (mes)
- "[Sirood]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5890 (mes)
- "I don't know why I can't breathe or why I don't feel hungry even if I don't eat."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5891 (mes)
- "[Sirood]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5892 (mes)
- "And observing the surroundings here, I could see small vortices forming occasionally."
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5893 (mes)
- "[Sirood]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/quests/quests_illusion_dungeons.txt#5894 (mes)
