+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1370 (mes)
- "Why am I so ticked off?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1371 (mes)
- "^3355FF*Sigh*^000000 You have something"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1372 (mes)
- "to show me? Huh? Benkaistein"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1373 (mes)
