+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1376 (mes)
- "[Benkaistein's Journal]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1377 (mes)
- "^856363Today, me, Digotz and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1378 (mes)
- "Maku played this crazy flying"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1379 (mes)
- "game. Basically, we make"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1380 (mes)
- "these wings out of wood and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1381 (mes)
- "paper, jump off these hills"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1382 (mes)
- "and try to fly. Dumb, I know.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1383 (mes)
- "[Benkaistein's Journal]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1384 (mes)
- "^856363Today it was my turn to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1385 (mes)
- "jump and flap my arms with"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1386 (mes)
- "these fake, badly made wings."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1387 (mes)
- "It's not really a fun game when"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1388 (mes)
- "I think about it. Boy, I hope"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1389 (mes)
- "we don't do that again.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1390 (cutin)
- "lhz_diguts02.bmp"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1391 (mes)
- "[Digotz]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1392 (mes)
- "Oh yeah, I remember that!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1393 (mes)
- "Maku wore the wings most"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1394 (mes)
- "of the time, but I still hold"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1395 (mes)
- "the record for staying in the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1396 (mes)
- "air the longest! Yeah, I was"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1397 (mes)
- "a regular Kid Pegasus~"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1399 (mes)
- "[Benkaistein's Journal]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1400 (mes)
- "^856363Maku, Digotz and me went"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1401 (mes)
- "outside of town. Of course,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1402 (mes)
- "we didn't tell anyone or else"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1403 (mes)
- "we'd get in trouble. It was"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1404 (mes)
- "a really exciting day. But"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1405 (mes)
- "then, we ran into a monster!^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1406 (mes)
- "[Benkaistein's Journal]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1407 (mes)
- "^856363I wanted to run away but Maku"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1408 (mes)
- "and Digotz wanted to beat it so"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1409 (mes)
- "that we could become heroes."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1410 (mes)
- "Of course, we got hurt pretty"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1411 (mes)
- "bad and the monster got away."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1412 (mes)
- "Boy, mom was not happy...^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1413 (cutin)
- "lhz_diguts03.bmp"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1414 (mes)
- "[Digotz]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1415 (mes)
- "Huh. I don't remember"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1416 (mes)
- "that so well. But I know that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1417 (mes)
- "Benkaistein, me and Maku"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1418 (mes)
- "weren't afraid of anything back"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1419 (mes)
- "then. We must have been totally"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1420 (mes)
- "nuts to fight a monster, though."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1422 (mes)
- "[Benkaistein's Journal]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1423 (mes)
- "^856363Digotz's been sick for three"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1424 (mes)
- "days now. It's just a normal"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1425 (mes)
- "cold and Maku keeps saying"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1426 (mes)
- "it's Digotz's fault he got sick.^FFFFFF ^856363 But he's always asking me to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1427 (mes)
- "go visit him and see if he's okay.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1428 (cutin)
- "lhz_diguts01.bmp"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1429 (mes)
- "[Digotz]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1430 (mes)
- "I think I remember being"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1431 (mes)
- "pretty sick. Maku was worried?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1432 (mes)
- "I... I must have had a horrible"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1433 (mes)
- "life threatening disease like,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1434 (mes)
- "um, Gonorrhitis. You know."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1435 (mes)
- "That might have been it."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1437 (mes)
- "[Benkaistein's Journal]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1438 (mes)
- "^856363Mom and dad keep telling"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1439 (mes)
- "me not to hang out with Maku"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1440 (mes)
- "anymore. Their reason is really"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1441 (mes)
- "dumb, and I don't care if he is"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1442 (mes)
- "poor. He's one of the best guys"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1443 (mes)
- "that I'll ever know.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1444 (mes)
- "[Benkaistein's Journal]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1445 (mes)
- "^856363Digotz's family is really"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1446 (mes)
- "rich and they don't want him"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1447 (mes)
- "to see Maku anymore either."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1448 (mes)
- "But Digotz doesn't care."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1449 (mes)
- "I know he likes Maku a lot.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1450 (cutin)
- "lhz_diguts07.bmp"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1451 (mes)
- "[Digotz]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1452 (mes)
- "Well, we were a lot"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1453 (mes)
- "younger and closer back"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1454 (mes)
- "then, so... ^333333*Ahem!*^000000 Why did"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1455 (mes)
- "Benkaistein even write that?!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1457 (mes)
- "[Benkaistein's Journal]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1458 (mes)
- "^856363Today, the three of us"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1459 (mes)
- "made an oath of brotherhood,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1460 (mes)
