+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1461 (mes)
- "book. We swore we'd always"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1462 (mes)
- "be friends no matter what."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1463 (mes)
- "For always and for always.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1464 (cutin)
- "lhz_diguts07.bmp"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1465 (mes)
- "[Digotz]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1466 (mes)
- "I... I was forced to make"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1467 (mes)
- "that oath! And people do"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1468 (mes)
- "change, you know! I mean,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1469 (mes)
- "we were basically just kids,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1470 (mes)
- "it's not like that oath really"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1471 (mes)
- "means anything now, does it?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1473 (mes)
- "[Digotz]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1474 (mes)
- "That does it. I'm gonna"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1475 (mes)
- "go see that Maku. I don't"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1476 (mes)
- "miss him or anything, but"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1477 (mes)
- "I gotta get him to cancel"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1478 (mes)
- "that oath. And maybe I'll"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1479 (mes)
- "beat up him a little bit."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1480 (mes)
- "[Digotz]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1481 (mes)
- "I don't understand"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1482 (mes)
- "why I'm so angry!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1483 (mes)
- "I'm starting to act"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1484 (mes)
- "more like Maku, though,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1485 (mes)
- "don't get me wrong, it's"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1486 (mes)
- "not like I care about the guy."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1487 (cutin)
- "lhz_diguts03.bmp"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1488 (mes)
