- "ass myself! Yeah, that's right!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1618 (mes)
- "Arrogant bastard! But still,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1619 (mes)
- "I'm not able to do that..."
