- "[Maku]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1722 (mes)
- "Hey, this thing is"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1723 (mes)
- "Benkaistein's. I haven't"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1724 (mes)
- "seen that guy in a long while."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1725 (mes)
- "Ah, so he gave it to you for me"
