- "lhz_macu06"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1729 (mes)
- "[Benkaistein's Journal]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1730 (mes)
- "^856363Today, me, Digotz and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1731 (mes)
- "Maku played this crazy flying"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1732 (mes)
- "game. Basically, we make"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1733 (mes)
- "these wings out of wood and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1734 (mes)
- "paper, jump off these hills"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1735 (mes)
- "and try to fly. Dumb, I know.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1736 (mes)
- "[Benkaistein's Journal]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1737 (mes)
- "^856363Today it was my turn to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1738 (mes)
- "jump and flap my arms with"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1739 (mes)
- "these fake, badly made wings."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1740 (mes)
- "It's not really a fun game when"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1741 (mes)
- "I think about it. Boy, I hope"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1742 (mes)
- "we don't do that again.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1743 (cutin)
- "lhz_macu03"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1744 (mes)
- "[Maku]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1745 (mes)
- "What is he talking about?!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1746 (mes)
- "That game was real fun!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1747 (mes)
- "Yeah, I usually wore the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1748 (mes)
- "wings and Digotz always"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1749 (mes)
- "wanted to wear them too."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1751 (mes)
- "[Benkaistein's Journal]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1752 (mes)
- "^856363Maku, Digotz and me went"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1753 (mes)
- "outside of town. Of course,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1754 (mes)
- "we didn't tell anyone or else"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1755 (mes)
- "we'd get in trouble. It was"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1756 (mes)
- "a really exciting day. But"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1757 (mes)
- "then, we ran into a monster!^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1758 (mes)
- "[Benkaistein's Journal]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1759 (mes)
- "^856363I wanted to run away but Maku"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1760 (mes)
- "and Digotz wanted to beat it so"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1761 (mes)
- "that we could become heroes."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1762 (mes)
- "Of course, we got hurt pretty"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1763 (mes)
- "bad and the monster got away."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#1764 (mes)
