+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4694 (mes)
- "what the obstacles are."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4695 (mes)
- "Jargeah, give me strength!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4696 (mes)
- "[Ghalstein]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4697 (mes)
- "Also, you've done a great"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4698 (mes)
- "service for us. Although we"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4699 (mes)
- "failed, you carried out your"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4700 (mes)
- "missions perfectly. Here,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4701 (mes)
- "take this antidote so that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4702 (mes)
- "you'll finally be free of us."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4703 (mes)
- "[Ghalstein]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4704 (mes)
- "I'd like you to take"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4705 (mes)
- "this small gift, as way"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4706 (mes)
- "of apology. We asked you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4707 (mes)
- "to do so much, but ultimately,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4708 (mes)
- "we weren't able to accomplish"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4709 (mes)
- "what we set out to do. Still..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4710 (mes)
- "[Ghalstein]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4711 (mes)
- "I'd like to thank you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4712 (mes)
- "for everything. Hopefully,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4713 (mes)
- "you found the answers"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4714 (mes)
- "that you were looking for"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4715 (mes)
- "when you decided to help"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4716 (mes)
- "us. Farewell, faithful friend."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4717 (mes)
- "[Ghalstein]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4718 (mes)
- "I hate being patient,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4719 (mes)
- "but the old adage is"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4720 (mes)
- "true. He who runs away,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4721 (mes)
- "lives to fight another day."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4722 (mes)
- "But that day seems so"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4723 (mes)
- "far off into the future..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4724 (mes)
- "[??????]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4725 (mes)
- "^666666Come on."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4726 (mes)
- "This way.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4727 (mes)
- "[??????]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4728 (mes)
- "^333333Hurry up, before"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4729 (mes)
- "the others see you...^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4730 (mes)
- "["
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4731 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4732 (mes)
- "(Wait a second..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4733 (mes)
- "That voice is"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4734 (mes)
- "awfully familiar.)"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4735 (select)
- "Ignore it."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4736 (select)
- "Keep listening."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4737 (mes)
- "["
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4738 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4739 (mes)
- "(That voice is"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4740 (mes)
- "awfully familiar..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4741 (mes)
- "But what do I care?)"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4742 (mes)
- "["
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4743 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4744 (mes)
- "(This is too weird."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4745 (mes)
- "I guess I better keep"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4746 (mes)
- "listening to see what"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4747 (mes)
- "I can learn about this...)"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4748 (mes)
- "[??????]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4749 (mes)
- "^333333So why did you tell"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4750 (mes)
- "me to come to such"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4751 (mes)
- "a dangerous place...?^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4752 (mes)
- "^3355FFThat's...^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4753 (mes)
- "That's ^660000Ghalstein's^3355FF voice!^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4754 (mes)
- "[????]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4755 (mes)
- "^666666Something unexpected"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4756 (mes)
- "came up. Hence the sudden"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4757 (mes)
- "change in plans. Now listen...^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4758 (mes)
- "^3355FFSuddenly, both of the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4759 (mes)
- "voices grew much quieter"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4760 (mes)
- "as the two men spoke to each"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4761 (mes)
- "other in low, hoarse whispers"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4762 (mes)
- "that are almost inaudible.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4763 (mes)
- "[????]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4764 (mes)
- "^666666...."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4765 (mes)
- "...Relate....."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4766 (mes)
- "...Business.....Kafr...^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4767 (mes)
- "[Ghalstein]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4768 (mes)
- "^333333Oh. That does"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4769 (mes)
- "sound very urgent."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4770 (mes)
- "But it's not safe to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4771 (mes)
- "talk about this here."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4772 (mes)
- "Let's move somewhere"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4773 (mes)
- "a little more secure.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4774 (mes)
- "[????]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4775 (mes)
- "^666666No problem."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4776 (mes)
- "........................^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4777 (mes)
- "........................"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4778 (mes)
- "....................."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4779 (mes)
- ".................."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4780 (mes)
- "^3355FFThat other voice..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4781 (mes)
- "Whoever it belonged"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4782 (mes)
- "to is gone! What's"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4783 (mes)
- "going on here?^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4784 (mes)
- "[Gushaar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4785 (mes)
- "Decisions, decisions."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4786 (mes)
- "Sometimes it's hard to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4787 (mes)
- "make a choice when it"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4788 (mes)
- "isn't clear which one will"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4789 (mes)
- "give you the most benefit."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4790 (mes)
- "[Gushaar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4791 (mes)
- "I think most of the good"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4792 (mes)
- "things in life have some"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4793 (mes)
- "kind of cost, but they're"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4794 (mes)
- "usually worth it. I mean,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4795 (mes)
- "nothing would have any"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4796 (mes)
- "worth without any cost, right?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4797 (mes)
- "[Gushaar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4798 (mes)
- "Alright. Choose"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4799 (mes)
- "your poison. I got"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4800 (mes)
- "two different kinds of"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4801 (mes)
- "tonics for you, red and blue."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4802 (mes)
- "So which one will you drink?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4803 (select)
- "????"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4804 (select)
- "Red Tonic"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4805 (select)
- "Blue Tonic"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4806 (mes)
- "[Gushaar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4807 (mes)
- "Well, when you don't"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4808 (mes)
- "make a decision, you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4809 (mes)
- "don't take action. And"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4810 (mes)
- "when you don't take any"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4811 (mes)
- "action, nothing happens."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4812 (mes)
- "Come on, don't be boring~"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4813 (mes)
- "[Gushaar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4814 (mes)
- "Red, huh? I like"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4815 (mes)
- "your style. But, eh,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4816 (mes)
- "isn't there something"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4817 (mes)
- "you want to show me first?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4818 (select)
- "Oh, right!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4819 (select)
- "What are you talking about?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4820 (mes)
- "[Gushaar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4821 (mes)
- "Hey... Umm..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4822 (mes)
- "Aren't you supposed"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4823 (mes)
- "to be carrying some"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4824 (mes)
- "sort of secret something?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4825 (mes)
- "I'd tell you want it was if we"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4826 (mes)
- "weren't so, well, secretive."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4827 (mes)
- "^3355FFYou suavely flash"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4828 (mes)
- "your Membership Card"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4829 (mes)
- "to Gushaar, who gives"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4830 (mes)
- "you an approving nod.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4831 (mes)
- "[Gushaar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4832 (mes)
- "Yeah, that's what"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4833 (mes)
- "I wanted to see. Good,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4834 (mes)
- "you're the one I've been"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4835 (mes)
- "waiting here for. Alright,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4836 (mes)
- "just give me a second..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4837 (mes)
- "[Gushaar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4838 (mes)
- "Huh?! Oh geez, I almost"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4839 (mes)
- "never make this mistake."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4840 (mes)
- "I'm sorry, I thought you might"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4841 (mes)
- "have been someone else."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4842 (mes)
- "[Gushaar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4843 (mes)
- "Blue...? Huh."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4844 (mes)
- "That shouldn't be"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4845 (mes)
- "the one you want."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4846 (mes)
- "Well, if you're who"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4847 (mes)
- "I think you are... Are you?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4848 (mes)
- "[Gushaar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4849 (mes)
- "Alright, first of all,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4850 (mes)
- "you should know why the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4851 (mes)
- "Rekenber Corporation is"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4852 (mes)
- "our sworn enemy. Did you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4853 (mes)
- "know that it basically controls"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4854 (mes)
- "the Schwarzwald Republic?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4855 (mes)
- "[Gushaar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4856 (mes)
- "They're so powerful, they"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4857 (mes)
- "manipulate everything in the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4858 (mes)
- "economy, media and even the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4859 (mes)
- "politics of this nation. There are other corporations, sure, but"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4860 (mes)
- "they're nothing in comparsion."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4861 (mes)
- "[Gushaar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4862 (mes)
- "Rekenber Corporation..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4863 (mes)
- "They've even got a hold on"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4864 (mes)
- "all the other companies, simply"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4865 (mes)
- "by bribing politicians to pass"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4866 (mes)
- "the bills they want passed."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4867 (mes)
- "This isn't a real republic..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4868 (mes)
- "[Gushaar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4869 (mes)
- "The ultimate goal of our"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4870 (mes)
- "group, ''Secret Wing,'' is to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4871 (mes)
- "establish true independence"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4872 (mes)
- "in the Schwarzwald Republic"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4873 (mes)
- "by destroying Rekenber Corporation."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4874 (mes)
- "[Gushaar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4875 (mes)
- "Fortunately, the new president"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4876 (mes)
- "of the Schwarzwald Republic,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4877 (mes)
- "Mr. Weierstrass, is sympathetic"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4878 (mes)
- "to our cause. He is working with us to bring about a revolution and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4879 (mes)
- "overthrow Rekenber Corporation."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4880 (mes)
- "[Gushaar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4881 (mes)
- "Your mission will be to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4882 (mes)
- "visit with the president and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4883 (mes)
- "bring back any information"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4884 (mes)
- "he may have for us. Remember,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4885 (mes)
- "because of his position, you can only see him during certain hours."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4886 (mes)
- "[Gushaar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4887 (mes)
- "I hope you understand"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4888 (mes)
- "''Secret Wing's'' ultimate"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4889 (mes)
- "goal now. In any case, you've"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4890 (mes)
- "got to meet our president,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4891 (mes)
- "Karl Theodor Weierstrass."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4892 (mes)
- "[Gushaar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4893 (mes)
- "It won't be easy to see"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4894 (mes)
- "such an important man,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4895 (mes)
- "so show your Secret Wing"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4896 (mes)
- "Membership Card to his"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4897 (mes)
- "secretary and there should"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4898 (mes)
- "be very little hassle."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4899 (mes)
- "[Gushaar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4900 (mes)
- "Because of his schedule,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4901 (mes)
- "you'll only be allowed to see"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4902 (mes)
- "him from ^FF00008:00 PM to 11:00 PM^000000,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4903 (mes)
- "and from ^FF000011:00 AM to 2:00PM PST^000000.Good luck on this mission, friend."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4904 (mes)
- "[Gushaar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4905 (mes)
- "Rekenber..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4906 (mes)
- "I shall see your"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4907 (mes)
- "destruction if it's the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4908 (mes)
- "very last thing I do!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4909 (mes)
- "[Hes O'Neil]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4910 (mes)
- "Good day, how"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4911 (mes)
- "may I help you?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_lighthalzen.txt#4912 (select)
