#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#40 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Ajegna]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#41 (mes)
- "The Lasagna Port is over that way!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#42 (mes)
- "Don't tell me you're here because you didn't know that."
