#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#45 (mes)
- "~Shrieks~ You startled me!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#46 (mes)
- "A human? Wow, what an odd-looking one!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#47 (mes)
- "[Paul]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#48 (mes)
- "So, you're that adventurer Doram, eh?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#49 (mes)
- "Hey, what do you think?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#50 (mes)
- "You agree with me about damage, right? STR comes first!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#51 (mes)
- "[Paul]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#52 (mes)
- "You need to be on the offense to win the battle."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#53 (mes)
- "^4d4dffThe quickest way to boost ATK is to boost STR^000000!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#54 (mes)
- "[MacCarnie]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#55 (mes)
- "...Reckless attacks are of no use!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#56 (mes)
- "No attack will work if you miss the target!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#57 (mes)
- "[MacCarnie]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#58 (mes)
- "So, ^4d4dffyou need to boost DEX first to increase Accuracy^000000."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#59 (mes)
- "It doesn't matter how strong you are. You need to hit the target first!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#60 (mes)
- "[MacCarnie]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#61 (mes)
- "I refuse to use martial arts willy-nilly as you do!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#62 (mes)
- "^4d4dffI'm using the summoning skill by boosting INT for magical attacks!^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#63 (mes)
- "[Paul]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#64 (mes)
- "Pfff! What's wrong with using the summoning skills to complement the physical skills?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#65 (mes)
- "Are you implying that I haven't got a clue?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#66 (mes)
- "[MacCarnie]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#67 (mes)
- "...That's not what I meant! This cat's brains must be full of fat!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#68 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Gnocchi]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#69 (mes)
- "...Stop fighting, you two!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#70 (mes)
- "Hey, there. Newcomer."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#71 (mes)
- "You can ask me if there is something you'd like to know."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#72 (npctalk)
- "You can ask me if there is something you'd like to know."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#73 (npctalk)
- "Vigilante Gnocchi#doramt13"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#74 (mes)
- "[Paul]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#75 (mes)
- "He might tell you What's good about being a Vigilante, so go ahead and ask him."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#76 (mes)
- "He'll prove that I was right, after all."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#77 (mes)
- "[Paul]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#78 (mes)
- "So, is this all about boosting your abilities based on your competencies?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#79 (mes)
- "[Paul]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#80 (mes)
- "Come to think of it, there is a ^4d4dffhypnotist^000000 in the village."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#81 (mes)
- "^4d4dffYou can reset skills and statuses through a hypnotist^000000. Just so you know that you can."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#82 (npctalk)
- "You, dimwit! Nothing beats damage! You should boost your STR first!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#83 (npctalk)
- "Applicant Paul#doramt13"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#84 (npctalk)
- "You have no idea! DEX comes first if you want your attack to be successful!!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#85 (npctalk)
- "Applicant MacCarnie#doramt13"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#90 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Gnocchi]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#91 (mes)
- "Ahem! This is like a gateway to the Far-Star Continent."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#92 (mes)
- "No more humans are allowed!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#93 (npctalk)
- "Do you happen to know why they are making so much noise?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#95 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Gnocchi]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#96 (mes)
- "So they were having an animated discussion over status."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#97 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Gnocchi]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#98 (mes)
- "Do you need more explanation on the status?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#99 (select)
- "Yes."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#100 (select)
- "No."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#101 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Gnocchi]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#102 (mes)
- "Up to level 49, the village hypnotist will reset your stats and skills."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#103 (mes)
- "This will let you practice and experiment which will help find the path that works for you."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#104 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Gnocchi]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#105 (mes)
- "Press the ^4d4dffAlt+Q^000000 keys to view your physical stats."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#106 (mes)
- "Calibration is also available depending on your equipment."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#107 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Gnocchi]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#108 (mes)
- "Let me explain the statuses in detail."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#109 (mes)
- "^4d4dffSTR means strength^000000. It ^4d4dffboosts physical attacks^000000."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#110 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Gnocchi]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#111 (mes)
- "^4d4dffVIT is vitality which indicates health^000000. This is what ^4d4dffboosts your overall HP^000000."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#112 (mes)
- "^4d4dffAGI means agility^000000. It affects ^4d4dffevasion and attack speed^000000."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#113 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Gnocchi]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#114 (mes)
- "^4d4dffINT refers to intelligence and MATK means magical attack^000000. If your skills are centered on magic, you must boost INT first and foremost."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#115 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Gnocchi]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#116 (mes)
- "^4d4dffDEX is related with dexterity and accuracy^000000."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#117 (mes)
- "You can both quicken casting speed and boost the accuracy of your attacks."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#118 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Gnocchi]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#119 (mes)
- "^4d4dffLUK means luck; the more luck you have, the higher your critical hit rate (CRI) becomes^000000."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#120 (mes)
- "It also means you can dodge an enemy's attack more easily."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#121 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Gnocchi]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#122 (mes)
- "If you want to boost your physical attacks, focus on STR. If what you want is magical attacks, go for INT. Got it?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#123 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Gnocchi]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#124 (mes)
- "DEX is highly crucial in the early stages because it is what boosts Accuracy."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#125 (mes)
- "This can be a difficult concept to get, so you should try boosting this and that to find your own way."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#126 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Gnocchi]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#127 (mes)
- "I wish you godspeed!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#129 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Aglio]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#130 (mes)
- "Oh! You must be the famous strangers from the New Continent, eh?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#131 (mes)
- "Out-of-towner Dorams abound in this place, I definitely don't want any more of them."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#132 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Aglio]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#133 (mes)
- "Wouldn't they be surprised to see you guys?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#134 (mes)
- "Moreover, it's dangerous to cross the mountain ridge."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#135 (mes)
- "This is for your own good. Just go back to where you come from."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#136 (mes)
- "- Hold on a second here!! -"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#137 (mes)
- "- You have too many items. -"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#138 (mes)
- "- That means you can no longer receive any items. -"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#139 (mes)
- "- Free up some space -"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#140 (mes)
- "- and try again. -"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#141 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Aglio]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#142 (mes)
- "Oh, hello?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#143 (mes)
- "I'm Aglio. I'm going to be your attendant from this point on."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#144 (mes)
- "Consider it a privilege."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#145 (mes)
- "Because I'm one of the ace members of the Farfalle Vigilante Corp."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#146 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Aglio]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#147 (mes)
- "I'm sure I can be of help for just about anything."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#148 (mes)
- "First off, let's see what you've got."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#149 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Aglio]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#150 (mes)
- "Hang on. Let me check if you are properly equipped first."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#151 (mes)
- "You don't want to fight with bare hands, now do you?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#152 (mes)
- "^4d4dffYou should equip your weapons.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#153 (cutin)
- "tutorial03.BMP"
