#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#215 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Aglio]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#216 (mes)
- "Well, then. ^4d4dffGo ahead and drink the apple juice that I gave you.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#217 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Aglio]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#218 (mes)
- "How do you like it? It's cool, sweet, and just good, right?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#219 (mes)
- "I would've given you more if I had any, but...no."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#220 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Aglio]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#221 (mes)
- "Oh, right! I'll give you this, too."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#222 (mes)
- "It'll restore your stamina if you take it when you're tired."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#223 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Aglio]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#224 (mes)
- "Also, I'll give you a new staff."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#225 (mes)
- "It should be better than that sprout you brought with you."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#226 (mes)
- "Now you know how to equip an item because I already explained it to you, don't you?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#228 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Aglio]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#229 (mes)
- "I'll direct you to the village, now."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#230 (npctalk)
- "....Aglioooooo!!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#231 (npctalk)
- "Kid#doram03t"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#232 (npctalk)
- "Oh, my days! You startled me!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#234 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Aglio]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#235 (mes)
- "What's up?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#236 (mes)
- "Oh, you're the youngest kitten of the tool merchant!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#237 (mes)
- "it's dangerous around here. What brought you all this way?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#238 (mes)
- "[The Youngest Kitten of the Tool Merchant]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#239 (mes)
- "Oh, actually...I lost it!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#240 (mes)
- "There was a box!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#241 (mes)
- "I was supposed to give it to Haru."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#242 (mes)
- "I was just trying to hang out for a while, but I fell down!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#243 (mes)
- "[The Youngest Kitten of the Tool Merchant]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#244 (mes)
- "Please find it, Aglio!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#245 (mes)
- "Or, I'm going to be in trouble!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#246 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Aglio]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#247 (mes)
- "So, you were running an errand to deliver a box to Healer Haru."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#248 (mes)
- "But you fell down while hanging out for a while and lost the box. Is that it?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#249 (mes)
- "[The Youngest Child of the Tool Merchant]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#250 (mes)
- "Yes, sir!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#251 (mes)
- "You're so good at summing it up!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#252 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Aglio]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#253 (mes)
- "Alright. You just return to your village."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#254 (mes)
- "I'll see what I can do. You return home and wait."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#255 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Aglio]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#256 (mes)
- "One more thing. Just drop that habit of acting like you're naive in front of the strangers!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#257 (mes)
- "[The Youngest Kitten of the Tool Merchant]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#258 (mes)
- "Come on...I'm the cutest, youngest kitten from Lasagna!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#259 (mes)
- "Anyway, I hope you help me by finding that box. Please."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#260 (npctalk)
- "You know that I love you, don't you?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#261 (npctalk)
- "Kid#doram03t"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#262 (npctalk)
- "Just go, already!"
