- "....."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#267 (mes)
- "........~Sighs deeply~..."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#268 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Aglio]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#269 (mes)
- "Well, there's no choice, then."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#272 (mes)
- "I think you can step up and handle it this time."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#273 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Aglio]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#274 (mes)
- "it's a relief to have a competent Doram with me."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#275 (mes)
- "My guess is that an ^4d4dffEggring must've eaten that box.^000000"
