#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#309 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Aglio]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#310 (mes)
- "What's in front of you is Lasagna, the harbor village."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#311 (mes)
- "You should bring that box to the tool shop first, right?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#312 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Aglio]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#313 (mes)
- "I'll let you know how to reach the village."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#314 (mes)
- "Follow the arrows that just appeared on the ground."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#315 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Aglio]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#316 (mes)
- "I'll be right behind you!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#317 (mes)
- "Don't worry about me. Just keep going."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#319 (mes)
- "[Vigilante Aglio]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#320 (mes)
- "Haven't you left for Midgard yet?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#321 (mes)
- "Well, problems do occur at the harbor from time to time, but I thought it wouldn't be an issue for you."
