+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#328 (mes)
- "[Sloth]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#329 (mes)
- "Hmm...You look energetic."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#330 (mes)
- "You see, I have an upset stomach."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#331 (mes)
- "[Sloth]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#332 (mes)
- "The weather is sunny and warm, but..."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#333 (mes)
- "I think I'm having a very bad day..."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#334 (mes)
- "[Sloth]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#335 (mes)
- "I should pluck all the Red Grass in this herb field..."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#336 (mes)
- "[Sloth]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#337 (mes)
- "But I'm pleasantly full in this fine sunny weather..."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#338 (mes)
- "And there's a good breeze blowing..."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#339 (mes)
- "[Sloth]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#340 (mes)
- "I don't think I can ever drag myself up."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#341 (mes)
- "But I'm supposed to pluck the Red Grass..."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#342 (mes)
- "If you do it I'll give you anchovies, okay?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#343 (select)
- "I'll pluck the Red Grass for you."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#344 (select)
- "Move your butt, you lazy sloth!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#345 (mes)
- "[Sloth]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#346 (mes)
- "^4d4dffPluck 3 Red Grass and then collect 2 Red Herbs^000000 around here!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#347 (mes)
- "[Sloth]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#348 (mes)
- "This may be of great help to you!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#349 (mes)
- "Well, then. I'm counting on you."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#350 (mes)
- "[Sloth]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#351 (mes)
- "I'll rest here to make my upset stomach feel better."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#352 (mes)
- "[Sloth]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#353 (mes)
- "Meeow...."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#354 (mes)
- "....Meeowww...."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#355 (mes)
- "[Sloth]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#356 (mes)
- "What I want isn't too much."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#357 (mes)
- "Just ^4d4dffpluck the Red Grass and collect 2 Red Herbs^000000 around here. That's all."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#358 (mes)
- "[Sloth]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#359 (mes)
- "They grow too fast and keep growing no matter how many times I pluck them. I've had it..."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#360 (mes)
- "[Sloth]"
+ ""
