#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#616 (mes)
- "[Healer Haru]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#617 (mes)
- "Oh, you'd like to learn about First Aid! How admirable of you!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#618 (mes)
- "First Aid is a skill converting your SP into HP in an emergency."
