#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#619 (mes)
- "[Healer Haru]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#620 (mes)
- "The healing amount can be minimal..."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#621 (mes)
- "But you can at least avoid getting stunned by a critical hit."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#622 (mes)
- "[Healer Haru]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#623 (mes)
- "Click the ^4d4dffSkill^000000 button to open the Skill Window."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#624 (mes)
