+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#626 (mes)
- "[Healer Haru]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#627 (mes)
- "Well, then. I'll let you in on something juicy while I'm at it."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#628 (mes)
