#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#687 (mes)
- "[Healer Haru]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#688 (mes)
- "Prepare the materials written in the combination scroll."
