- "[Healer Haru]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#716 (mes)
- "If you happen to meet a human in the Midgard Continent, why don't you ask them?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#719 (mes)
- "[Hypnotist]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#720 (mes)
- "Oh! So you're that famous human everyone is talking about!"
