#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#722 (mes)
- "[Hypnotist]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#723 (mes)
- "Have you come down with a skin disease or something?"
