#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#852 (mes)
- "[Vongolo]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#853 (mes)
- "Oh, It's really good..."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#854 (npctalk)
- "Earth element defeats Wind element."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#856 (npctalk)
- "Water element is superior to Fire element."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#858 (npctalk)
- "Wind element outperforms Water element."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#860 (npctalk)
- "Fire element beats Earth element."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#862 (npctalk)
- "Holy element and Dark element are in stark contrast to each other."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#864 (mes)
- "[Property Cat]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#865 (mes)
- "Every life in this world comes with a property."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#866 (mes)
- "There are numerous kinds of elements from neutral to four major natural elements, alongside the holy and dark elements."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#867 (mes)
- "[Property Cat]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#868 (mes)
- "Most representative elements are the natural ones."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#869 (mes)
- "Put simply, these are the elements of Water, Wind, Earth, and Fire."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#870 (mes)
- "Besides, there are elements of Undead, Holiness and Darkness."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#871 (mes)
- "[Property Cat]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#872 (mes)
- "Each element is intertwined with each other. So be smart and use the opposing elements."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#873 (mes)
- "[Property Cat]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#874 (mes)
- "That way, you can get the upper hand of a battle."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#875 (mes)
- "Let me give you a brief example on their correlation."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#876 (mes)
- "[Property Cat]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#877 (mes)
- "Fire element is highly resistant to Earth element."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#878 (mes)
- "Meanwhile, Earth element definitely outperforms Wind element."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#879 (mes)
- "[Property Cat]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#880 (mes)
- "Wind element beats Water element."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#881 (mes)
- "Yet, Water element defeats Fire element."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#882 (mes)
- "[Property Cat]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#883 (mes)
- "Holy element and Dark element directly oppose each other, and you should keep that in mind."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#884 (mes)
- "[Property Cat]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#885 (mes)
- "Other than that, there are also Neutral and Undead elements. You'll soon know what they are about."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#886 (mes)
- "You will have to see it for yourself."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#887 (mes)
- "- Hold on a second here!! -"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#888 (mes)
- "- You have too many items. -"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#889 (mes)
