+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#891 (mes)
- "- and try again. -"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#892 (mes)
- "[Cat Paw Commerce Group]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#893 (mes)
- "Hey, little fellow!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#894 (mes)
- "Are you headed to the Midgard Continent?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#895 (mes)
- "Then, you'd better listen to me!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#896 (mes)
- "[Cat Paw Commerce Group]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#897 (mes)
- "Like our Cat Paw Commerce Group, there are other groups who provide the ^4d4dffLocation sharing service^000000 and the ^4d4dffWarehouse service^000000."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#898 (mes)
- "[Cat Paw Commerce Group]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#899 (mes)
- "They are: ^4d4dffKafra^000000 and ^4d4dffZonda^000000."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#900 (mes)
- "Of course, don't forget about the Cat Paw Commerce Group!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#901 (mes)
- "[Cat Paw Commerce Group]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#902 (mes)
- "^4d4dffLocation sharing^000000 is to save the location for you to return to."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#903 (mes)
- "If you fall down due to fatigue during an adventure, you should return to the village. That's what you can do with this service."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#904 (mes)
- "[Cat Paw Commerce Group]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#905 (mes)
- "Use the ^4d4dffButterfly Wings^000000 item to fly straight to that location."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#906 (mes)
- "[Cat Paw Commerce Group]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#907 (mes)
- "Most of the locations shared are the safe village or city."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#908 (mes)
- "[Cat Paw Commerce Group]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#909 (mes)
- "The ^4d4dffWarehouse service^000000 is also similar."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#910 (mes)
- "You pay a little service fee to deposit your items safely."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#911 (mes)
- "[Cat Paw Commerce Group]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#912 (mes)
- "You can't just carry around every item with you, can you?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#913 (mes)
- "This is where the warehouse comes in handy."
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#914 (mes)
- "[Cat Paw Commerce Group]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#915 (mes)
- "You can deposit and take out your item in the warehouse anytime, anywhere if you pay the service fee!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#916 (mes)
- "Now do you get it?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#917 (mes)
- "[Cat Paw Commerce Group]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/custom/lasagna/lasagna_npcs.txt#918 (mes)
- "Oh, do you want me to explain it again?"
